const MODULE9 = {"module":9,"title":"Pediatrics","titleAr":"طب الأطفال","intro":{"audience":"A general doctor developing pediatric expertise who needs practical spoken **Egyptian Arabic** for pediatric clinics, emergency care, neonatal services, ward rounds, and communication with children and families.","safety":"This file is a **language and communication training resource**, not a pediatric clinical protocol, diagnostic guide, medicine formulary, or substitute for professional supervision. All patients and treatments are fictional. Clinical decisions must follow current local guidelines, age- and weight-specific assessment, institutional safeguarding/consent policy, and senior review where needed. The dialogues intentionally do not prescribe drug quantities, fixed vaccine schedules, or emergency algorithms. Urgent danger signs are presented to trigger assessment and escalation, not independent treatment.","gender":"The example doctor often speaks as a **female physician**, matching the dialogue context. Egyptian Arabic frequently marks gender in verb endings and forms of address. Change these where required in real conversations. Family dialogue represents various genders and ages, and the child’s voice is included wherever appropriate.","exercises":[{"title":"Comprehension","text":"identify the complaint, caregiver, age, timeline, concerns and proposed next step."},{"title":"Pronunciation","text":"say each Arabic turn using the transcription only as a guide; check rhythm with a native Egyptian speaker where possible."},{"title":"Doctor role","text":"reply in Egyptian Arabic without reading the English."},{"title":"Caregiver / child role","text":"switch roles, giving varied and sometimes incomplete answers."},{"title":"Clinical explanation","text":"practice communicating uncertainty, consent, team coordination and safety-netting without over-promising."},{"title":"Teach-back and reflection","text":"invite the caregiver to restate the plan and correct any misunderstandings in plain language."}],"howTo":"Read each lesson’s objective; practice the complete conversation aloud with a partner or language tutor; swap roles; then carry out the scenario variation without looking at the English. The Egyptian Arabic is conversational rather than formal Modern Standard Arabic. The romanization is a speaking aid, not a phonetic standard. Pronunciation and regional usage should be checked with an Egyptian clinician or native Egyptian Arabic speaker before deployment in real patient interactions."},"units":[{"n":1,"title":"Communication with Children and Families","focus":"Foundational consultations, trust, family composition, and child-facing language.","lessons":["M09_L01","M09_L02","M09_L03","M09_L04"],"vocab":[{"ar":"أم / ماما","lat":"omm / mama","en":"mother / mom"},{"ar":"أب / بابا","lat":"ab / baba","en":"father / dad"},{"ar":"جدة / جد","lat":"gedda / gedd","en":"grandmother / grandfather"},{"ar":"خالة / خال","lat":"khala / khal","en":"maternal aunt / uncle"},{"ar":"عمة / عم","lat":"amma / amm","en":"paternal aunt / uncle"},{"ar":"ولي أمر","lat":"wali amr","en":"legal guardian"},{"ar":"ابني / بنتي","lat":"ebni / benti","en":"my son / my daughter"},{"ar":"حضرتك","lat":"hadretak / hadretik","en":"respectful “you” (male / female)"},{"ar":"يا بطل / يا شاطرة","lat":"ya batal / ya shatra","en":"encouragement for boy / girl"},{"ar":"ممكن؟","lat":"momken?","en":"may I / could we?"}]},{"n":2,"title":"Clinical History and Examination","focus":"Structured history, danger signs, past history and explaining examinations.","lessons":["M09_L05","M09_L06","M09_L07","M09_L08"],"vocab":[{"ar":"أعراض","lat":"a‘rad","en":"symptoms"},{"ar":"بدأ إمتى؟","lat":"beda emta?","en":"when did it begin?"},{"ar":"بيزيد","lat":"beyezeed","en":"getting worse / increasing"},{"ar":"بيخف","lat":"beyekheff","en":"getting better / easing"},{"ar":"وجع","lat":"waga‘","en":"pain"},{"ar":"كشف","lat":"kashf","en":"clinical examination"},{"ar":"علامات حيوية","lat":"alamat hayaweyya","en":"vital signs"},{"ar":"نبض","lat":"nabd","en":"pulse"},{"ar":"نفس","lat":"nafas","en":"breath / breathing"},{"ar":"حساسية","lat":"hassaseyya","en":"allergy"},{"ar":"تركيز الدوا","lat":"tarkeez ed-dawa","en":"medicine concentration"},{"ar":"عملية","lat":"amaliyya","en":"operation / surgery"}]},{"n":3,"title":"Common Childhood Illnesses","focus":"Presenting symptoms, assessment, uncertainty, and escalation.","lessons":["M09_L09","M09_L10","M09_L11","M09_L12"],"vocab":[{"ar":"سخونية","lat":"sokhoneyya","en":"fever"},{"ar":"كحة","lat":"kohha","en":"cough"},{"ar":"رشح","lat":"rashah","en":"runny nose"},{"ar":"صفير","lat":"safeer","en":"wheezing / whistling"},{"ar":"ضيق نفس","lat":"dee‘ nafas","en":"breathing difficulty"},{"ar":"ترجيع","lat":"targee‘","en":"vomiting"},{"ar":"إسهال","lat":"es-hal","en":"diarrhea"},{"ar":"جفاف","lat":"gafaf","en":"dehydration"},{"ar":"بول","lat":"bol","en":"urine"},{"ar":"طفح","lat":"tafah","en":"rash"},{"ar":"هرش","lat":"harash","en":"itching"},{"ar":"ودن","lat":"wedn","en":"ear"},{"ar":"حلق","lat":"hal‘","en":"throat"}]},{"n":4,"title":"Newborn and Infant Care","focus":"Birth history, feeding, jaundice, neonatal monitoring, and family support.","lessons":["M09_L13","M09_L14","M09_L15","M09_L16"],"vocab":[{"ar":"بيبي","lat":"baby","en":"baby"},{"ar":"مولود","lat":"mawlood","en":"newborn"},{"ar":"حضانة","lat":"haddana","en":"neonatal unit / incubator (context)"},{"ar":"رضاعة","lat":"reda‘a","en":"feeding / breastfeeding"},{"ar":"رضعة","lat":"rad‘a","en":"one feed"},{"ar":"بيرضع","lat":"beyerda‘","en":"is feeding"},{"ar":"تركيبة لبن صناعي","lat":"tarkeebet laban sena‘i","en":"infant formula"},{"ar":"حفاضة","lat":"hafada","en":"diaper"},{"ar":"وزن الولادة","lat":"wazn el-welada","en":"birth weight"},{"ar":"صفار","lat":"sefar","en":"jaundice"},{"ar":"قبل معاده","lat":"abl me‘ado","en":"preterm / born early"},{"ar":"خمول","lat":"khomool","en":"lethargy"},{"ar":"متابعة","lat":"motaba‘a","en":"follow-up / monitoring"}]},{"n":5,"title":"Growth, Development and Preventive Care","focus":"Nutrition, immunization, development, adolescents and confidentiality.","lessons":["M09_L17","M09_L18","M09_L19","M09_L20"],"vocab":[{"ar":"نمو","lat":"nomow","en":"growth"},{"ar":"تطور","lat":"tatawwor","en":"development"},{"ar":"وزن","lat":"wazn","en":"weight"},{"ar":"طول","lat":"tool","en":"height / length"},{"ar":"منحنى النمو","lat":"monhana en-nomow","en":"growth curve"},{"ar":"تطعيم","lat":"ta‘teem","en":"vaccine / vaccination"},{"ar":"كارت التطعيمات","lat":"kart et-ta‘teemat","en":"vaccination card"},{"ar":"سمع","lat":"sam‘","en":"hearing"},{"ar":"تخاطب","lat":"takhatob","en":"speech and language support"},{"ar":"خصوصية","lat":"khososeyya","en":"privacy"},{"ar":"مراهق","lat":"morahe‘","en":"adolescent"}]},{"n":6,"title":"Chronic and Complex Pediatric Conditions","focus":"Asthma, allergy, epilepsy, complex care and long-term partnership.","lessons":["M09_L21","M09_L22","M09_L23","M09_L24"],"vocab":[{"ar":"ربو","lat":"rabw","en":"asthma"},{"ar":"بخاخ","lat":"bakhakh","en":"inhaler"},{"ar":"نوبة","lat":"nawba","en":"attack / episode"},{"ar":"محفزات","lat":"mohaffezat","en":"triggers"},{"ar":"إكزيما","lat":"ekzeema","en":"eczema"},{"ar":"تورم","lat":"tawarrom","en":"swelling"},{"ar":"تشنجات","lat":"tashannogat","en":"seizures / convulsions"},{"ar":"دواء مستمر","lat":"dawa mostamer","en":"regular medication"},{"ar":"تأثير جانبي","lat":"ta‘seer ganabi","en":"side effect"},{"ar":"خطة رعاية","lat":"khottet re‘aya","en":"care plan"},{"ar":"إحالة","lat":"ehala","en":"referral"}]},{"n":7,"title":"Diagnosis, Treatment and Procedures","focus":"Explanation, medicines, investigations and shared decisions.","lessons":["M09_L25","M09_L26","M09_L27","M09_L28"],"vocab":[{"ar":"تشخيص","lat":"tashkhees","en":"diagnosis"},{"ar":"احتمال","lat":"ehtemal","en":"possibility"},{"ar":"نتيجة","lat":"nateega","en":"result"},{"ar":"تحليل","lat":"tahleel","en":"laboratory test"},{"ar":"أشعة","lat":"ash‘a","en":"imaging / X-ray"},{"ar":"وصفة","lat":"wasfa","en":"prescription"},{"ar":"جرعة","lat":"gor‘a","en":"dose"},{"ar":"ملي","lat":"milli","en":"milliliter (mL)"},{"ar":"سرنجة فموية","lat":"serenga famaweyya","en":"oral syringe"},{"ar":"أعراض جانبية","lat":"a‘rad ganabeyya","en":"side effects"},{"ar":"موافقة","lat":"mowafa‘a","en":"consent"},{"ar":"مخاطر","lat":"makhater","en":"risks"},{"ar":"فوائد","lat":"fawayed","en":"benefits"}]},{"n":8,"title":"Pediatric Emergencies and Escalation","focus":"Recognizing deterioration and communicating urgent response or transfer.","lessons":["M09_L29","M09_L30","M09_L31","M09_L32"],"vocab":[{"ar":"طوارئ","lat":"taware‘","en":"emergency department / emergency"},{"ar":"إسعاف","lat":"es‘af","en":"ambulance / emergency aid"},{"ar":"فوراً","lat":"fawran","en":"immediately"},{"ar":"تدهور","lat":"tadahwor","en":"deterioration"},{"ar":"وعي","lat":"wa‘y","en":"consciousness"},{"ar":"أكسجين","lat":"oksigeen","en":"oxygen"},{"ar":"علامة خطر","lat":"alamet khatar","en":"danger sign"},{"ar":"نقل","lat":"na‘l","en":"transfer"},{"ar":"تحويل","lat":"tahweel","en":"referral / transfer"},{"ar":"تقرير","lat":"ta‘reer","en":"report"},{"ar":"فريق الطوارئ","lat":"faree‘ et-taware‘","en":"emergency team"},{"ar":"استجابة","lat":"estegaba","en":"response"}]},{"n":9,"title":"Hospital Teams, Aftercare and Follow-Up","focus":"Nursing handover, consultant review, hospital logistics and discharge.","lessons":["M09_L33","M09_L34","M09_L35","M09_L36"],"vocab":[{"ar":"ممرضة","lat":"momarrida","en":"nurse"},{"ar":"سستر","lat":"sister","en":"colloquial hospital address for nurse"},{"ar":"طبيب استشاري","lat":"tabeeb esteshari","en":"consultant"},{"ar":"مناوبة","lat":"monawba","en":"shift"},{"ar":"تسليم الحالة","lat":"tasleem el-hala","en":"clinical handover"},{"ar":"سرير","lat":"sereer","en":"bed"},{"ar":"معمل","lat":"ma‘mal","en":"laboratory"},{"ar":"صيدلي","lat":"saydali","en":"pharmacist"},{"ar":"استقبال","lat":"este‘bal","en":"reception"},{"ar":"دخول","lat":"dokhool","en":"admission"},{"ar":"خروج","lat":"khoroog","en":"discharge"},{"ar":"ورقة خروج","lat":"wara‘et khoroog","en":"discharge summary"},{"ar":"علامات خطر","lat":"alamat khatar","en":"warning signs"},{"ar":"ميعاد متابعة","lat":"me‘ad motaba‘a","en":"follow-up appointment"}]}],"lessons":[{"id":"M09_L01","module":9,"lesson":1,"unit":1,"title":"First Pediatric Consultation","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Child","arc":"Opening a consultation; consent, identity, history, plan","objectives":"Introduce yourself; establish the child's identity and caregiver relationship; set a shared agenda; explain next steps.","roleplay":"Role-play a mother who is worried but cannot describe the problem clearly; ask permission to examine the child; summarize the plan in plain Egyptian Arabic.","caution":"Address the caregiver politely; include the child whenever developmentally appropriate.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أهلاً يا مدام، أنا دكتورة سارة من قسم الأطفال.","lat":"Ahlan ya madam, ana doktora Sara men esm el-atfal.","en":"Hello, I'm Dr Sara from pediatrics."},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"أهلاً يا دكتورة، ابني تعبان من امبارح.","lat":"Ahlan ya doktora, ebni ta'ban men embareh.","en":"Hello doctor, my son has been unwell since yesterday."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"اسم ابن حضرتك إيه وعنده كام سنة؟","lat":"Esm ebn hadretik eh we ando kam sana?","en":"What's your son's name and how old is he?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"اسمه يوسف وعنده ست سنين.","lat":"Esmo Youssef we ando sett seneen.","en":"His name is Youssef and he's six."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حضرتك مامته؟","lat":"Hadretik mamto?","en":"Are you his mother?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، أنا مامته.","lat":"Aywa, ana mamto.","en":"Yes, I'm his mother."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا يوسف، إزيك يا حبيبي؟ تقدر تقولي إيه اللي مضايقك؟","lat":"Ya Youssef, ezzayyak ya habibi? Te'dar te'olli eh elli medaye'ak?","en":"Youssef, how are you? Can you tell me what's bothering you?"},{"n":8,"who":"Child","ar":"حلقي بيوجعني.","lat":"Hal'i beyewga'ni.","en":"My throat hurts."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تمام، هنسمع من يوسف ومن ماما كمان.","lat":"Tamam, hanesma' men Youssef we men mama kaman.","en":"Okay, we'll hear from Youssef and Mom too."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الوجع بدأ إمتى؟ وهل فيه سخونية؟","lat":"El-waga' beda emta? We hal feeh sokhoneyya?","en":"When did the pain start? Has there been a fever?"},{"n":11,"who":"Mother","ar":"من بالليل، وحسيت إنه سخن.","lat":"Men belleil, we hasseet enno sekhen.","en":"Since last night, and he felt hot."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قستِ الحرارة بترمومتر؟","lat":"Esti el-harara be-termometer?","en":"Did you check his temperature with a thermometer?"},{"n":13,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، ما قستهاش.","lat":"La', ma'estahash.","en":"No, I didn't measure it."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ينفع أكشف عليه بعد ما أشرح له هعمل إيه؟","lat":"Yenfa' akshif aleih ba'd ma ashrahalo ha'mel eh?","en":"May I examine him after I explain what I'll do?"},{"n":15,"who":"Mother","ar":"طبعاً.","lat":"Tab'an.","en":"Of course."},{"n":16,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هكشف عليه الأول، وبعدين هقول لحضرتك إيه اللي لقيته والخطوة الجاية.","lat":"Hakshif aleih el-awwel, we ba'dein ha'ool le-hadretik eh elli le'eeto wel-khotwa el-gayya.","en":"I'll examine him first, then explain the findings and next steps."}],"scenario":"Opening a consultation; consent, identity, history, plan (context: Mother, Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L02","module":9,"lesson":2,"unit":1,"title":"Speaking with Fathers","speakers":"Doctor, Father","arc":"Detailed history and father's questions","objectives":"Ask focused follow-up questions; avoid assumptions about which parent provides care; address uncertainty.","roleplay":"Father reports cough only, but child becomes breathless while playing; explore chronology and offer a clear plan.","caution":"Use respectful masculine address for the father; do not assume a father knows less than the mother.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أهلاً بحضرتك، إيه اللي مقلقك على بنتك؟","lat":"Ahlan be-hadretak, eh elli me'alla'ak ala bentak?","en":"Welcome, what's worrying you about your daughter?"},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"بنتي بتكح بقالها أربع أيام.","lat":"Benti betekohh ba'alha arba' ayam.","en":"My daughter has been coughing for four days."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عندها كام سنة؟","lat":"Andaha kam sana?","en":"How old is she?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"عندها سبع سنين.","lat":"Andaha sab' seneen.","en":"She's seven."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الكحة بتزيد بالليل ولا طول اليوم؟","lat":"El-kohha betzeed belleil walla tool el-yom?","en":"Is the cough worse at night or throughout the day?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"بالليل أكتر، وبتصحى من النوم.","lat":"Belleil aktar, we betes'ha men en-nom.","en":"More at night; it wakes her up."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه صفير في الصدر أو صعوبة في النفس؟","lat":"Feeh safeer fis-sadr aw so'ooba fin-nafas?","en":"Any wheezing or difficulty breathing?"},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"ساعات بسمع صوت صفارة لما تجري.","lat":"Sa'at basma' sot saffaara lamma tegri.","en":"Sometimes I hear a whistle when she runs."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حصل كده قبل كده؟","lat":"Hasal keda abl keda?","en":"Has this happened before?"},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"أيوه، السنة اللي فاتت.","lat":"Aywa, es-sana elli fatet.","en":"Yes, last year."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"استخدمتوا بخاخ أو أي علاج؟","lat":"Estakhdemto bakhakh aw ay elag?","en":"Have you used an inhaler or any treatment?"},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"عندنا بخاخ قديم بس ما استخدمناهوش.","lat":"Andena bakhakh adeem bas ma estakhdemnahoosh.","en":"We have an old inhaler but haven't used it."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"كويس إنك قلتلي؛ هراجع اسم البخاخ وتاريخه.","lat":"Kowayyes ennak oltelli; harage' esm el-bakhakh we tareekho.","en":"Thanks for mentioning it; I'll check its name and date."},{"n":14,"who":"Father","ar":"يعني عندها ربو؟","lat":"Ya'ni andaha rabw?","en":"Does that mean she has asthma?"},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لسه ما نقدرش نجزم؛ محتاجين تاريخ كامل وكشف.","lat":"Lessa ma ne'darsh negzem; mehtageen tareekh kamel we kashf.","en":"We can't be certain yet; we need a full history and examination."},{"n":16,"who":"Father","ar":"طب نعمل إيه بعد الكشف؟","lat":"Tab ne'mel eh ba'd el-kashf?","en":"What will we do after the examination?"},{"n":17,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هشرح لك الاحتمالات والخطة وعلامات الخطر اللي لازم تنتبه لها.","lat":"Hashrah lak el-ehtemalat wel-khotta we alamat el-khatar elli lazem tentebeh laha.","en":"I'll explain the possibilities, the plan, and the warning signs to watch for."}],"scenario":"Detailed history and father's questions (context: Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L03","module":9,"lesson":3,"unit":1,"title":"Other Family Members and Caregivers","speakers":"Doctor, Grandmother","arc":"Caregiver identity; reliable history; guardianship","objectives":"Verify who is present; collect observations without assuming legal authority; contact the guardian for nonurgent decisions.","roleplay":"Grandmother knows feeding details but not medication names; arrange clarification without delaying urgent care.","caution":"Consent rules depend on local law and the clinical situation; seek authorized consent while not delaying emergency stabilization.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حضرتك تقربي للطفلة إيه؟","lat":"Hadretik te'rabi lel-tefla eh?","en":"What's your relationship to the girl?"},{"n":2,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"أنا جدتها، ومامتها في الشغل.","lat":"Ana gettaha, we mametha fish-shoghl.","en":"I'm her grandmother; her mother is at work."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"متشكرة إن حضرتك جيتي معاها.","lat":"Motshakkera enn hadretik geeti ma'aha.","en":"Thank you for bringing her."},{"n":4,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"بقالها يومين مش بتاكل كويس.","lat":"Ba'alha yomein mesh betakol kowayyes.","en":"She hasn't been eating well for two days."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مين بيقضي معاها أغلب اليوم؟","lat":"Meen bey'addi ma'aha aghlab el-yom?","en":"Who spends most of the day with her?"},{"n":6,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"أنا، وبنتي بتستلمها بالليل.","lat":"Ana, we benti betestelemha belleil.","en":"I do, and my daughter takes over at night."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لاحظتي إنها بتشرب أقل أو بتدخل الحمام أقل؟","lat":"Lahezti ennaha beteshrab a'all aw betedkhol el-hammam a'all?","en":"Have you noticed less drinking or urination?"},{"n":8,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"أيوه، حفاضاتها أقل من العادي.","lat":"Aywa, hafadatha a'all mel-adi.","en":"Yes, she's having fewer wet diapers than usual."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أخدت أي دواء؟","lat":"Akhadet ay dawa?","en":"Has she taken any medicine?"},{"n":10,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"خالتها ادتها دوا، بس مش فاكرة اسمه.","lat":"Khaletha eddetha dawa, bas mesh fakra esmo.","en":"Her aunt gave her medicine, but I don't remember its name."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن نكلم خالتها ونسأل عن الاسم والكمية؟","lat":"Momken nekallem khaletha we nes'al an el-esm wel-kammeyya?","en":"Can we call her aunt and ask the name and amount?"},{"n":12,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"أيوه، هكلمها.","lat":"Aywa, hakallemha.","en":"Yes, I'll call her."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"وممكن نتواصل مع مامتها أو ولي أمرها كمان؟","lat":"We momken netwasel ma'a mametha aw wali amraha kaman?","en":"Can we also contact her mother or legal guardian?"},{"n":14,"who":"Grandmother","ar":"حاضر، عندي رقمها.","lat":"Hader, andi ra'amha.","en":"Sure, I have her number."},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنبدأ التقييم دلوقتي، ومش هنأخر أي رعاية عاجلة.","lat":"Hanebda et-ta'yeem delwa'ti, we mesh han'akhkhar ay re'aya agela.","en":"We'll assess her now and won't delay urgent care."}],"scenario":"Caregiver identity; reliable history; guardianship (context: Grandmother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L04","module":9,"lesson":4,"unit":1,"title":"Speaking Directly with Children","speakers":"Doctor, Child","arc":"Trust, assent, explanation, pain language","objectives":"Speak at child level; explain each step; respect distress; use play-based choices appropriately.","roleplay":"Child refuses an ear examination; try a choice between examining left or right first without giving a false choice about needed care.","caution":"Avoid promising that a painful procedure will not hurt; be honest and reassuring.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"صباح الخير يا بطل، اسمك إيه؟","lat":"Sabah el-kheir ya batal, esmak eh?","en":"Good morning, champ. What's your name?"},{"n":2,"who":"Child","ar":"اسمي آدم.","lat":"Esmi Adam.","en":"My name is Adam."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا آدم، بتحب الديناصورات ولا العربيات؟","lat":"Ya Adam, bethebb ed-dinasorat walla el-arabeyyat?","en":"Adam, do you like dinosaurs or cars?"},{"n":4,"who":"Child","ar":"العربيات.","lat":"El-arabeyyat.","en":"Cars."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حلو! العربية اللي معاك لونها إيه؟","lat":"Helw! El-arabeyya elli ma'ak lawnha eh?","en":"Nice! What color is the car you're holding?"},{"n":6,"who":"Child","ar":"أحمر.","lat":"Ahmar.","en":"Red."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن توريني فين الوجع بإيدك؟","lat":"Momken tewarreeni fein el-waga' be-eedak?","en":"Can you show me with your hand where it hurts?"},{"n":8,"who":"Child","ar":"ودني اليمين.","lat":"Wedni el-yemeen.","en":"My right ear."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هبص في ودنك بكشاف صغير، ينفع؟","lat":"Haboss fi wednak be-kashaf soghayyar, yenfa'?","en":"I'll look in your ear with a little light, okay?"},{"n":10,"who":"Child","ar":"أنا خايف.","lat":"Ana khayef.","en":"I'm scared."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاهمة، وماما هتفضل جنبك.","lat":"Fahma, we mama hatefdal gambak.","en":"I understand, and Mom will stay beside you."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تحب نبدأ بالودن اليمين ولا الشمال؟","lat":"Tehebb nebda bel-wedn el-yemeen walla esh-shemal?","en":"Shall we start with the right or left ear?"},{"n":13,"who":"Child","ar":"الشمال.","lat":"Esh-shemal.","en":"The left."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تمام، ولو محتاجين نوقف لحظة قولّي.","lat":"Tamam, we law mehtageen new'af lahza olli.","en":"Okay. Tell me if we need to pause for a moment."},{"n":15,"who":"Child","ar":"حاضر.","lat":"Hader.","en":"Okay."},{"n":16,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شاطر يا آدم، شكراً إنك بتساعدني.","lat":"Shater ya Adam, shokran ennak betsa'edni.","en":"Well done, Adam. Thanks for helping me."}],"scenario":"Trust, assent, explanation, pain language (context: Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L05","module":9,"lesson":5,"unit":2,"title":"Taking a Complete Pediatric History","speakers":"Doctor, Mother","arc":"Onset, course, associated symptoms, function","objectives":"Elicit an open history; sequence onset and progression; review intake, urine, activity, exposures.","roleplay":"Parent jumps between symptoms; organize time course without interrupting important details.","caution":"Avoid leading the parent toward a particular diagnosis before examination.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"احكيلي من الأول إيه اللي حصل.","lat":"Ehkeeli men el-awwel eh elli hasal.","en":"Tell me from the beginning what happened."},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"يوم الجمعة بدأ يشتكي من بطنه.","lat":"Yom el-gom'a beda yeshtaki men batno.","en":"On Friday he started complaining of tummy pain."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الوجع بدأ فجأة ولا بالتدريج؟","lat":"El-waga' beda fag'a walla bet-tadreeg?","en":"Did the pain start suddenly or gradually?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"بالتدريج، وبعدين زاد.","lat":"Bet-tadreeg, we ba'dein zad.","en":"Gradually, then it got worse."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فين مكان الوجع بالضبط؟","lat":"Fein makan el-waga' bez-zabt?","en":"Where exactly is the pain?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"الأول حوالين السرّة، ودلوقتي ناحية اليمين.","lat":"El-awwel hawalein es-serra, we delwa'ti naheyyet el-yemeen.","en":"First near his belly button, now on the right."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه ترجيع أو إسهال أو سخونية؟","lat":"Feeh targee' aw es-hal aw sokhoneyya?","en":"Any vomiting, diarrhea, or fever?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"رجّع مرتين وما أكلش النهارده.","lat":"Ragga' marratein we ma akalsh ennaharda.","en":"He vomited twice and hasn't eaten today."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قادر يشرب؟ ودخل الحمام إمتى آخر مرة؟","lat":"Ader yeshrab? We dekhel el-hammam emta akher marra?","en":"Can he drink? When did he last urinate?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"شرب رشفات، ودخل الحمام الصبح.","lat":"Shereb rashafat, we dekhel el-hammam es-sobh.","en":"He took sips and urinated this morning."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه حد في البيت عنده نفس الأعراض؟","lat":"Feeh hadd fil-beit ando nafs el-a'rad?","en":"Anyone at home with similar symptoms?"},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، مفيش.","lat":"La', mafish.","en":"No, nobody."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الوجع بيزيد مع الحركة؟","lat":"El-waga' beyezeed ma'a el-haraka?","en":"Does the pain worsen with movement?"},{"n":14,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، مش عايز يمشي.","lat":"Aywa, mesh ayiz yemshi.","en":"Yes, he doesn't want to walk."},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"دي معلومات مهمة، وهنكشف عليه فوراً ونشوف محتاج تقييم عاجل إزاي.","lat":"Di ma'lomat mohemma, we hanekshif aleih fawran we neshoof mehtag ta'yeem agel ezzay.","en":"That's important. We'll examine him immediately and determine the urgent assessment needed."}],"scenario":"Onset, course, associated symptoms, function (context: Mother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L06","module":9,"lesson":6,"unit":2,"title":"Identifying Concerning Symptoms","speakers":"Doctor, Father, Mother, Nurse","arc":"Emergency red flags and escalation","objectives":"Screen for danger signs with clear questions; explain why immediate assessment matters.","roleplay":"Caregiver reports low activity, poor drinking and a seizure; escalate without finishing a routine history.","caution":"Acute red flags require urgent clinician assessment according to local emergency protocols.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الطفل صاحي وبيتفاعل معاكم زي العادي؟","lat":"Et-tefl sahi we beyitfa'el ma'akum zay el-adi?","en":"Is the child awake and interacting normally?"},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"لأ، نايم طول الوقت وصعب نصحيه.","lat":"La', nayem tool el-wa't we sa'b nesahhee.","en":"No, he's sleeping all the time and hard to wake."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قادر يشرب أو يرضع؟","lat":"Ader yeshrab aw yerda'?","en":"Can he drink or breastfeed?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، بيرفض كل حاجة.","lat":"La', beyerfod kol haga.","en":"No, he's refusing everything."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"رجّع كل اللي شربه؟","lat":"Ragga' kol elli sherebo?","en":"Has he vomited everything he's drunk?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"أيوه، كل مرة.","lat":"Aywa, kol marra.","en":"Yes, every time."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حصلت تشنجات أو فقدان وعي؟","lat":"Hasalet tashannogat aw fo'dan wa'y?","en":"Any seizures or loss of consciousness?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"إيده ورجله اتهزّوا من شوية.","lat":"Eedo we reglo ettehazzo men shewayya.","en":"His arms and legs shook a little while ago."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"التشنج استمر قد إيه؟","lat":"Et-tashannog estammar add eh?","en":"How long did the seizure last?"},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"مش متأكدين، كنا خايفين.","lat":"Mesh meta'akkedeen, kunna khayfeen.","en":"We're not sure; we were frightened."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لازم الفريق يقيمه حالاً؛ دي علامات خطر.","lat":"Lazem el-faree' ye'ayyemo halan; di alamat khatar.","en":"The team needs to assess him immediately; these are danger signs."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا سستر، محتاجة مساعدة عاجلة هنا.","lat":"Ya sister, mehtaga mosa'ada agela hena.","en":"Nurse, I need urgent assistance here."},{"n":13,"who":"Nurse","ar":"حاضر، هنبدأ التقييم فوراً.","lat":"Hader, hanebda et-ta'yeem fawran.","en":"Yes, we'll start the assessment right away."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنفضل نشرح لكم اللي بنعمله خطوة بخطوة.","lat":"Hanefdal neshrah lakum elli bena'melo khotwa be-khotwa.","en":"We'll explain what we're doing step by step."}],"scenario":"Emergency red flags and escalation (context: Father, Mother, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L07","module":9,"lesson":7,"unit":2,"title":"Medical, Birth, Family and Medication History","speakers":"Doctor, Mother","arc":"Past history, birth details, drug reconciliation and allergy","objectives":"Obtain chronological clinical context, distinguish medicine from allergy, clarify past admissions.","roleplay":"Parent says “allergic to antibiotics” without details; clarify specific drug and reaction.","caution":"Record patient history accurately; no child medication dose should be assumed from age alone.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"اتولد في معاده ولا قبل المعاد؟","lat":"Etweled fi me'ado walla abl el-me'ad?","en":"Was he born at term or early?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"اتولد قبل معاده بأربع أسابيع.","lat":"Etweled abl me'ado be-arba' asabee'.","en":"He was born four weeks early."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"احتاج حضانة بعد الولادة؟","lat":"Ehtag haddana ba'd el-welada?","en":"Did he need neonatal care after birth?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، قعد أسبوع.","lat":"Aywa, e'ed esboo'.","en":"Yes, he stayed for a week."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"دخل المستشفى قبل كده أو عمل عملية؟","lat":"Dekhel el-mostashfa abl keda aw amel amaliyya?","en":"Has he been admitted before or had surgery?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"دخل مرة بسبب التهاب في الصدر.","lat":"Dekhel marra besabab eltehab fis-sadr.","en":"He was admitted once for a chest infection."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عنده أي أمراض مزمنة أو بياخد علاج باستمرار؟","lat":"Ando ay amrad mozmena aw beyakhod elag bestemrar?","en":"Any chronic conditions or regular medications?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"بياخد دوا كل يوم للصدر.","lat":"Beyakhod dawa kol yom les-sadr.","en":"He takes daily medicine for his chest."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن أشوف اسمه وتركيزه؟","lat":"Momken ashoof esmo we tarkeezo?","en":"Can I see its name and concentration?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، صورت العلبة.","lat":"Aywa, sawwart el-elba.","en":"Yes, I photographed the box."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عنده حساسية من أي دواء؟","lat":"Ando hassaseyya men ay dawa?","en":"Any medication allergies?"},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"مرة طلع له طفح بعد مضاد حيوي.","lat":"Marra tele' lo tafah ba'd modad hayawi.","en":"He once developed a rash after an antibiotic."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاكرة اسم الدوا؟ وحصل تورم أو ضيق نفس؟","lat":"Fakra esm ed-dawa? We hasal tawarrom aw dee' nafas?","en":"Remember the drug name? Was there swelling or breathing difficulty?"},{"n":14,"who":"Mother","ar":"ما حصلش ضيق نفس، بس مش فاكرة الاسم.","lat":"Ma hasalsh dee' nafas, bas mesh fakra el-esm.","en":"No breathing trouble, but I don't remember the name."},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنكتب التفاصيل اللي نعرفها، وهنحاول نتأكد من الدوا قبل أي وصفة.","lat":"Hanekteb et-tafaseel elli ne'rafha, we hanhawel net'akked men ed-dawa abl ay wasfa.","en":"We'll document what we know and try to identify the drug before prescribing."}],"scenario":"Past history, birth details, drug reconciliation and allergy (context: Mother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L08","module":9,"lesson":8,"unit":2,"title":"Physical Examination and Explaining Findings","speakers":"Doctor, Father, Child","arc":"Vital signs, permission and explanation of findings","objectives":"Explain the examination sequence; reduce fear; describe findings and uncertainty.","roleplay":"Young child pulls away during chest auscultation; explain and allow caregiver support.","caution":"Examination findings alone may not establish a diagnosis; avoid false reassurance.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنقيس الحرارة والنبض والتنفس الأول.","lat":"Hane'ees el-harara wen-nabd wet-tanaffos el-awwel.","en":"We'll measure temperature, pulse, and breathing first."},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"هو خايف من الأجهزة.","lat":"Howwa khayef mel-agheza.","en":"He's afraid of the equipment."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هوريه الجهاز الأول من غير ما ألمسه.","lat":"Hawareeh el-gehaz el-awwel men gheir ma almeso.","en":"I'll show him the device first without touching him."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا بطل، ده جهاز بيسمع صوت قلبك.","lat":"Ya batal, da gehaz biyesma' sot albak.","en":"Champ, this device listens to your heart."},{"n":5,"who":"Child","ar":"هيقرصني؟","lat":"Haye'rosni?","en":"Will it pinch me?"},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لأ، السماعة هتلمس صدرك بس وممكن تبقى ساقعة شوية.","lat":"La', es-samma'a hatelmes sadrak bas we momken teb'a sa'e'a shewayya.","en":"No, the stethoscope will touch your chest and may feel a little cold."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"خد نفس عادي، وأنا هسمع.","lat":"Khod nafas adi, we ana hasma'.","en":"Breathe normally while I listen."},{"n":8,"who":"Child","ar":"كده؟","lat":"Keda?","en":"Like this?"},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أيوه، ممتاز.","lat":"Aywa, momtaz.","en":"Yes, excellent."},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"لقيتي حاجة؟","lat":"Le'eeti haga?","en":"Did you find anything?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"النفس سريع شوية، وعايزة أراجع نسبة الأكسجين كمان.","lat":"En-nafas saree' shewayya, we ayza arage' nesbet el-oksigeen kaman.","en":"The breathing is a little fast; I'd also like to check oxygen saturation."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"يعني التهاب رئوي؟","lat":"Ya'ni eltehab re'awi?","en":"Does that mean pneumonia?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مش بالضرورة؛ هنربط الكشف بالأعراض وباقي النتائج.","lat":"Mesh bed-darora; hanerbot el-kashf bel-a'rad we ba'i en-natayeg.","en":"Not necessarily. We'll interpret the exam alongside symptoms and other findings."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هشرح لك لو محتاجين فحوصات أو متابعة.","lat":"Hashrah lak law mehtageen fohosat aw motaba'a.","en":"I'll explain whether testing or follow-up is needed."}],"scenario":"Vital signs, permission and explanation of findings (context: Father, Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L09","module":9,"lesson":9,"unit":3,"title":"Fever and Possible Infection","speakers":"Doctor, Mother","arc":"Fever, assessment, differential, medicine questions","objectives":"Clarify measured fever, duration, age and systemic symptoms; explain that fever is a sign and not a diagnosis.","roleplay":"Parent demands an antibiotic; explain why assessment matters and when escalation is needed.","caution":"Fever in young infants can require immediate assessment. Do not teach a single fever threshold or treatment plan for every age.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حرارة ابنك وصلت لكام بالترمومتر؟","lat":"Hararet ebnek weslet le-kam bet-termometer?","en":"How high was your son's measured temperature?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"وصلت تسعة وتلاتين بالليل.","lat":"Weslet tes'a we talateen belleil.","en":"It reached 39 last night."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بدأ يسخن من إمتى؟","lat":"Beda yeskhan men emta?","en":"When did the fever begin?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"من امبارح بعد الضهر.","lat":"Men embareh ba'd ed-dohr.","en":"Yesterday afternoon."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بيشرب وبيصحى ويتفاعل معاكم؟","lat":"Beyeshrab we beyis'ha we beyitfa'el ma'akum?","en":"Is he drinking, waking and interacting with you?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"بيشرب شوية، وبيتكلم معايا.","lat":"Beyeshrab shewayya, we beyetkallem ma'aya.","en":"He drinks a little and talks to me."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه طفح أو صعوبة في التنفس أو تشنجات؟","lat":"Feeh tafah aw so'ooba fit-tanaffos aw tashannogat?","en":"Any rash, breathing difficulty or seizures?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، بس عنده رشح.","lat":"La', bas ando rashah.","en":"No, but he has a runny nose."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أخد خافض حرارة؟ اسمه إيه وكميته قد إيه؟","lat":"Akhad khafed harara? Esmo eh we kammeyto add eh?","en":"Has he had fever medicine? What is it and how much was given?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، بس مش فاكرة التركيز.","lat":"Aywa, bas mesh fakra et-tarkeez.","en":"Yes, but I don't remember the concentration."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنراجع العبوة والوزن قبل ما نتكلم عن أي جرعة.","lat":"Hanerage' el-'obwa wel-wazn abl ma netkallem an ay gor'a.","en":"We'll check the packaging and weight before discussing any dose."},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"هو محتاج مضاد حيوي؟","lat":"Howwa mehtag modad hayawi?","en":"Does he need an antibiotic?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مش كل سخونية سببها بكتيريا، ومش كل حالة محتاجة مضاد.","lat":"Mesh kol sokhoneyya sababha bacteria, we mesh kol hala mehtaga modad.","en":"Not every fever is bacterial, and not every case needs an antibiotic."},{"n":14,"who":"Mother","ar":"طب هنرجع إمتى لو ما خفش؟","lat":"Tab hanerga' emta law ma kheffesh?","en":"When should we return if he doesn't improve?"},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هحدد المتابعة وعلامات الخطر بعد الكشف، ولو حالته ساءت ما تستنوش.","lat":"Hahadded el-motaba'a we alamat el-khatar ba'd el-kashf, we law halto sa'et ma testannosh.","en":"I'll set follow-up and danger signs after examination; don't wait if he worsens."}],"scenario":"Fever, assessment, differential, medicine questions (context: Mother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L10","module":9,"lesson":10,"unit":3,"title":"Cough, Cold and Breathing Problems","speakers":"Doctor, Father, Nurse","arc":"Cough pattern, wheeze, work of breathing, urgent escalation","objectives":"Distinguish parent descriptions of cough, congestion, stridor and wheeze; ask about functional impact.","roleplay":"Caregiver reports the child “just has a cold” but describes chest recession; obtain immediate assessment.","caution":"Avoid dismissing respiratory distress as routine cough; prioritize breathing assessment.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الكحة ناشفة ولا فيها بلغم؟","lat":"El-kohha nashfa walla feeha balgham?","en":"Is the cough dry or productive?"},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"ناشفة وأكتر حاجة بالليل.","lat":"Nashfa we aktar haga belleil.","en":"Dry and mainly at night."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"في رشح أو انسداد في الأنف؟","lat":"Fi rashah aw ensedad fil-anf?","en":"Is there a runny or blocked nose?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"مناخيره مسدودة طول الوقت.","lat":"Manakheero masdooda tool el-wa't.","en":"His nose is blocked all the time."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بتلاحظ إن نفسه سريع أو صدره بيدخل لجوه؟","lat":"Betlahez en nafaso saree' aw sadro beyedkhol legowwa?","en":"Have you noticed fast breathing or his chest pulling inward?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"آه، بينهج وصدره بيتشد.","lat":"Ah, beynahag we sadro beyitshadd.","en":"Yes, he's breathless and his chest is pulling in."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"دي علامة محتاجة تقييم فوري.","lat":"Di alama mehtaga ta'yeem fawri.","en":"That's a sign needing immediate assessment."},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا سستر، ممكن تقيسي الأكسجين والعلامات الحيوية حالاً؟","lat":"Ya sister, momken te'eesi el-oksigeen wel-alamat el-hayaweyya halan?","en":"Nurse, could you check oxygen saturation and vital signs immediately?"},{"n":9,"who":"Nurse","ar":"حاضر يا دكتورة.","lat":"Hader ya doktora.","en":"Right away, doctor."},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"هياخد جلسة بخار؟","lat":"Hayakhod galset bokhar?","en":"Will he have a nebulizer treatment?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"العلاج هيعتمد على التقييم وسبب ضيق النفس.","lat":"El-elag haye'temed ala et-ta'yeem we sabab dee' en-nafas.","en":"Treatment will depend on the assessment and cause of the breathing difficulty."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"أقدر أفضل جنبه؟","lat":"A'dar afdal gambo?","en":"Can I stay beside him?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أيوه، طالما ده ما بيعطّلش الرعاية.","lat":"Aywa, talama da ma bey'attelsh er-re'aya.","en":"Yes, as long as it doesn't interfere with care."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنبلغك بالنتائج والخطوة الجاية أول بأول.","lat":"Hanballaghak ben-natayeg wel-khotwa el-gayya awwel be-awwel.","en":"We'll update you about the findings and next steps."}],"scenario":"Cough pattern, wheeze, work of breathing, urgent escalation (context: Father, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L11","module":9,"lesson":11,"unit":3,"title":"Vomiting, Diarrhea and Abdominal Pain","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Child","arc":"Fluid loss, abdominal pain, dehydration, follow-up","objectives":"Quantify frequency and intake; assess urine output and activity; communicate safety netting.","roleplay":"Parent cannot recall number of vomits; use time anchors and ask about the last wet diaper.","caution":"Persistent inability to drink, lethargy, blood in stool, or severe focal abdominal pain needs urgent assessment.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"رجّع كام مرة من الصبح؟","lat":"Ragga' kam marra men es-sobh?","en":"How many times has he vomited since morning?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"أربع مرات تقريباً.","lat":"Arba' marrat ta'reeban.","en":"About four times."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"وفيه إسهال؟","lat":"We fee es-hal?","en":"Any diarrhea?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، تلات مرات.","lat":"Aywa, talat marrat.","en":"Yes, three times."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه دم في البراز أو الترجيع؟","lat":"Fee dam fil-boraz aw et-targee'?","en":"Any blood in stool or vomit?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، ما شفتش دم.","lat":"La', ma shoftesh dam.","en":"No, I haven't seen blood."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"آخر مرة عمل بول إمتى؟","lat":"Akher marra amel bol emta?","en":"When did he last urinate?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"من ست ساعات تقريباً.","lat":"Men sett sa'at ta'reeban.","en":"Roughly six hours ago."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قادر يحتفظ بأي سوائل ولا بيرجّعها كلها؟","lat":"Ader yehtafez be-ay sawaye' walla beyregga'ha kollaha?","en":"Can he keep any fluids down or does he vomit them all?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"بيرجّع كل حاجة تقريباً.","lat":"Beyregga' kol haga ta'reeban.","en":"He's vomiting almost everything."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ده يقلقنا، وعايزة نقيم الجفاف وحالته العامة بسرعة.","lat":"Da ye'alla'na, we ayza ne'ayyem el-gafaf we halto el-amma besor'a.","en":"That's concerning; I want to assess dehydration and his overall condition quickly."},{"n":12,"who":"Child","ar":"بطني بتوجعني هنا.","lat":"Batni betewga'ni hena.","en":"My tummy hurts here."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الوجع بيزيد لما تتحرك؟","lat":"El-waga' beyezeed lamma tetharrak?","en":"Does it worsen when you move?"},{"n":14,"who":"Child","ar":"أيوه، جامد.","lat":"Aywa, gamed.","en":"Yes, a lot."},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هكشف على بطنك بالراحة وهنقرر لو محتاج فحوصات عاجلة.","lat":"Hakshif ala batnak ber-raha we han'arrar law mehtag fohosat agela.","en":"I'll examine your tummy gently and decide whether urgent tests are needed."},{"n":16,"who":"Mother","ar":"طب أديه آكل إيه؟","lat":"Tab addih yakol eh?","en":"What should I feed him?"},{"n":17,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنحدد خطة الأكل والسوائل بعد ما نطمن على حالته الأول.","lat":"Han-hadded khottet el-akl wes-sawaye' ba'd ma netmen ala halto el-awwel.","en":"We'll plan food and fluids after assessing his condition first."}],"scenario":"Fluid loss, abdominal pain, dehydration, follow-up (context: Mother, Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L12","module":9,"lesson":12,"unit":3,"title":"Ear, Throat, Skin and Pain Complaints","speakers":"Doctor, Child, Mother","arc":"Pain sites; rash, ear and throat examination","objectives":"Ask child-friendly pain questions; describe rash without prematurely labeling; explain examination.","roleplay":"Parent reports an itchy rash after a new medicine; clarify respiratory symptoms immediately.","caution":"Facial swelling, breathing trouble, or a rapidly worsening severe rash needs urgent assessment.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إيه أكتر حاجة مضايقاكي يا ليلى؟","lat":"Eh aktar haga medaye'aki ya Leila?","en":"What bothers you most, Leila?"},{"n":2,"who":"Child","ar":"ودني بتوجعني.","lat":"Wedni betewga'ni.","en":"My ear hurts."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"اليمين ولا الشمال؟","lat":"El-yemeen walla esh-shemal?","en":"Right or left?"},{"n":4,"who":"Child","ar":"الشمال.","lat":"Esh-shemal.","en":"Left."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الوجع بدأ إمتى؟","lat":"El-waga' beda emta?","en":"When did it start?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"من امبارح، وكمان ظهر طفح على جسمها.","lat":"Men embareh, we kaman zahar tafah ala gesmaha.","en":"Yesterday; she also developed a rash."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الطفح ظهر قبل الدوا ولا بعده؟","lat":"Et-tafah zahar abl ed-dawa walla ba'do?","en":"Did the rash appear before or after the medicine?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"بعد دوا جديد بساعتين.","lat":"Ba'd dawa gedeed be-sa'atein.","en":"Two hours after a new medicine."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حصل تورم في الشفايف أو صعوبة في النفس؟","lat":"Hasal tawarrom fish-shefayef aw so'ooba fin-nafas?","en":"Any lip swelling or trouble breathing?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، بس فيه هرش جامد.","lat":"La', bas fee harash gamed.","en":"No, but there is severe itching."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"محتاجة أعرف اسم الدوا ونفحص الطفح.","lat":"Mehtaga a'raf esm ed-dawa we nefhas et-tafah.","en":"I need the medicine name and to examine the rash."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا ليلى، هبص على جلدك وودنك، ينفع؟","lat":"Ya Leila, haboss ala geldik we wednik, yenfa'?","en":"Leila, may I look at your skin and ear?"},{"n":13,"who":"Child","ar":"أيوه، بس بالراحة.","lat":"Aywa, bas ber-raha.","en":"Yes, but gently."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حاضر؛ ولو حسّيتي بوجع قوليلي.","lat":"Hader; we law hasseiti be-waga' ollili.","en":"Of course; tell me if it hurts."}],"scenario":"Pain sites; rash, ear and throat examination (context: Child, Mother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L13","module":9,"lesson":13,"unit":4,"title":"Newborn Examination","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father","arc":"Birth history, newborn assessment, normal explanation","objectives":"Ask delivery and gestation details; elicit feeding, urine and activity; explain newborn checks.","roleplay":"Parent reports newborn sleeping more than expected; differentiate normal sleep from difficulty waking and feeding problems.","caution":"Newborn red flags, fever or hypothermia, and poor feeding require prompt assessment.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ألف مبروك! البيبي اتولد إمتى؟","lat":"Alf mabrook! El-baby etweled emta?","en":"Congratulations! When was the baby born?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"من تلات أيام.","lat":"Men talat ayam.","en":"Three days ago."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الولادة كانت طبيعية ولا قيصري؟","lat":"El-welada kanet tabee'eyya walla aysari?","en":"Was it a vaginal delivery or a C-section?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"قيصري، بس ما حصلتش مشاكل.","lat":"Aysari, bas ma hasaletsh mashakel.","en":"A C-section, but there were no complications."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"اتولد في معاده؟ ووزنه وقت الولادة كان كام؟","lat":"Etweled fi me'ado? We wazno wa't el-welada kan kam?","en":"Was he full term? What was his birth weight?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"أيوه، في معاده، ووزنه تلاتة كيلو تقريباً.","lat":"Aywa, fi me'ado, we wazno talata kilo ta'reeban.","en":"Yes, at term, and about three kilos."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بيرضع كل قد إيه؟","lat":"Beyerda' kol add eh?","en":"How often is he feeding?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"كل شوية، بس ساعات بيبقى صعب أصحيه.","lat":"Kol shewayya, bas sa'at beyeb'a sa'b asahhee.","en":"Frequently, but sometimes he's difficult to wake."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لما بيصحى، بيرضع كويس ولا بيضعف بسرعة؟","lat":"Lamma beyes'ha, beyerda' kowayyes walla beyed'af besor'a?","en":"When he wakes, does he feed well or tire quickly?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"ساعات ما بيكملش الرضعة.","lat":"Sa'at ma beykammelsh er-rad'a.","en":"Sometimes he doesn't finish a feed."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مهم نقيم الرضاعة والنشاط والحرارة دلوقتي.","lat":"Mohem ne'ayyem er-reda'a wen-nashat wel-harara delwa'ti.","en":"It's important to assess feeding, activity and temperature now."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"هتكشفي عليه إزاي؟","lat":"Hatekshefi aleih ezzay?","en":"How will you examine him?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هفحص التنفس والقلب والجلد والبطن والحركة، وهنشرح كل خطوة.","lat":"Hafhas et-tanaffos wel-alb wel-geld wel-batn wel-haraka, we haneshrah kol khotwa.","en":"I'll check breathing, heart, skin, abdomen and movement, explaining every step."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ولو لقينا علامة مقلقة، هنرتب تقييم متخصص من غير تأخير.","lat":"We law le'eena alama me'alle'a, hanratteb ta'yeem motakhasses men gheir ta'kheer.","en":"If we find a worrying sign, we'll arrange specialist assessment without delay."}],"scenario":"Birth history, newborn assessment, normal explanation (context: Mother, Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L14","module":9,"lesson":14,"unit":4,"title":"Breastfeeding, Formula and Feeding Difficulties","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Nurse","arc":"Feeding pattern, latch, expressed milk, safety","objectives":"Ask nonjudgmentally about breast/formula feeding, latch, wet diapers and weight trend.","roleplay":"Parent is embarrassed about using formula; offer practical, neutral language and assess concerns.","caution":"Feeding advice must be individualized; don't presume the newborn is well if feeding poorly.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الرضاعة ماشية معاكي إزاي؟","lat":"Er-reda'a mashya ma'aki ezzay?","en":"How is feeding going for you?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"بصراحة تعبانة، والبيبي مش بيمسك كويس.","lat":"Besaraha ta'bana, wel-baby mesh beyemsek kowayyes.","en":"Honestly, I'm tired and the baby isn't latching well."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ده متعب فعلاً، ومش هنلومك على أي اختيار.","lat":"Da mota'eb fe'lan, we mesh hanloomik ala ay ekhtiyar.","en":"That really is tiring; we're not here to judge your choices."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بترضعيه طبيعي ولا صناعي ولا الاتنين؟","lat":"Beterda'eeh tabee'i walla sena'i walla el-etnein?","en":"Are you breastfeeding, formula feeding, or both?"},{"n":5,"who":"Mother","ar":"الاتنين، وبقلق إنه مش بيشبع.","lat":"El-etnein, we ba'la' enno mesh beyishba'.","en":"Both, and I worry he isn't getting enough."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بيبلّل كام حفاضة في اليوم؟","lat":"Beyballil kam hafada fil-yom?","en":"How many wet diapers does he have daily?"},{"n":7,"who":"Mother","ar":"مش عارفة بالضبط، بس أقل من قبل.","lat":"Mesh arfa bez-zabt, bas a'all men abl.","en":"I don't know exactly, but fewer than before."},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه ترجيع شديد أو خمول أو حرارة؟","lat":"Feeh targee' shadeed aw khomool aw harara?","en":"Any severe vomiting, lethargy, or fever?"},{"n":9,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، بس ساعات بينام وهو بيرضع.","lat":"La', bas sa'at beynam we howwa beyerda'.","en":"No, but sometimes he falls asleep feeding."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنشوف وزنه ونراجع الرضاعة عملياً مع الفريق.","lat":"Haneshoof wazno we nerage' er-reda'a amaleyyan ma'a el-faree'.","en":"We'll check his weight and review feeding practically with the team."},{"n":11,"who":"Nurse","ar":"لو تحبي، أقدر أساعدك تشوفي وضعية مريحة.","lat":"Law tehebbi, a'dar asa'edek tshoofi wad'eyya moreeha.","en":"If you'd like, I can help you find a comfortable position."},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"ياريت، لأن عندي ألم.","lat":"Ya reit, le'enn andi alam.","en":"Please, because I'm in pain."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مهم كمان نسمع منك عن الألم ونتأكد إن البيبي بياخد كفايته.","lat":"Mohem kaman nesma' mennik an el-alam we net'akked en el-baby beyakhod kefayto.","en":"We also need to discuss your pain and ensure the baby gets enough."},{"n":14,"who":"Mother","ar":"كده أنا مطمنة إننا هنراجع الموضوع.","lat":"Keda ana motmenna ennana hanerage' el-mawdoo'.","en":"I feel reassured we'll look into this."}],"scenario":"Feeding pattern, latch, expressed milk, safety (context: Mother, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L15","module":9,"lesson":15,"unit":4,"title":"Neonatal Jaundice and Warning Signs","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father","arc":"Jaundice onset, feeding, tests and escalation","objectives":"Ask when yellowness began; explain assessment and possible investigations without preempting results.","roleplay":"Parent asks whether “sunlight at home” is sufficient; explain need for measurement and clinician-guided care.","caution":"Jaundice in first 24 hours, poor feeding, marked lethargy, or yellow palms and soles may indicate urgency; follow neonatal protocols.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الصفار ظهر من إمتى؟","lat":"Es-sefar zahar men emta?","en":"When did the yellowing appear?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"من امبارح، وعينه باينة صفرا.","lat":"Men embareh, we eino bayna safra.","en":"Yesterday; his eyes look yellow."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"كان عمره كام ساعة لما لاحظتوه؟","lat":"Kan omro kam sa'a lamma laheztouh?","en":"How many hours old was he when you first noticed it?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"حوالي يومين.","lat":"Hawalei yomein.","en":"About two days."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بيرضع كويس؟ وبيعمل حفاضات مبلولة؟","lat":"Beyerda' kowayyes? We beya'mel hafadat mabloola?","en":"Is he feeding well and having wet diapers?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"الرضاعة قلت شوية.","lat":"Er-reda'a ellet shewayya.","en":"His feeding has decreased a little."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"نشاطه عامل إيه؟ بيصحى للرضاعة؟","lat":"Nashato amel eh? Beyis'ha ler-reda'a?","en":"How active is he? Does he wake for feeding?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"بقى أنعس من الأول.","lat":"Be'a an'as mel-awwel.","en":"He's sleepier than before."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"محتاجين نقيس نسبة الصفار ونقيم حالته من غير تأخير.","lat":"Mehtageen ne'ees nesbet es-sefar we ne'ayyem halto men gheir ta'kheer.","en":"We need to measure his bilirubin and assess him without delay."},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"ممكن نخليه في الشمس وخلاص؟","lat":"Momken nekhalleeh fish-shams we khalas?","en":"Can we just put him in sunlight?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ما ينفعش نعتمد على الشمس كعلاج؛ القرار حسب القياس وعمر البيبي.","lat":"Ma yenfa'sh ne'temed ala esh-shams ka-elag; el-arar hasab el-eyas we omr el-baby.","en":"We shouldn't rely on sunlight as treatment; decisions depend on the measurement and baby's age."},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"ولو محتاج حضانة؟","lat":"We law mehtag haddana?","en":"What if he needs neonatal admission?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنشرح السبب والخطوات قبل أي إجراء، ونشرككم في القرار المناسب.","lat":"Haneshrah es-sabab wel-khotawat abl ay egra', we neshrekkom fil-arar el-monasib.","en":"We'll explain why and what's involved before procedures and involve you in decisions."}],"scenario":"Jaundice onset, feeding, tests and escalation (context: Mother, Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L16","module":9,"lesson":16,"unit":4,"title":"Premature and Medically Vulnerable Infants","speakers":"Father, Doctor, Mother, NICU nurse","arc":"NICU care, monitoring, uncertainty and family support","objectives":"Explain monitoring, referrals and progress to parents without guarantees; invite questions.","roleplay":"Parent worries about multiple monitors and tube feeds; explain each simply and avoid ungrounded prognosis.","caution":"NICU care decisions require the neonatology team and local policies.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Father","ar":"هو ليه لسه في الحضانة؟","lat":"Howwa leh lessa fil-haddana?","en":"Why is he still in neonatal care?"},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لأنه اتولد بدري ومحتاج متابعة للتنفس والرضاعة والوزن.","lat":"Le'enno etweled badri we mehtag motaba'a lit-tanaffos wer-reda'a wel-wazn.","en":"Because he was born early and needs monitoring of breathing, feeding and weight."},{"n":3,"who":"Mother","ar":"كل الأجهزة دي بتعمل إيه؟","lat":"Kol el-agheza di beta'mel eh?","en":"What do all these machines do?"},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"جزء منها بيراقب النبض والتنفس ونسبة الأكسجين.","lat":"Goz' menha beyra'eb en-nabd wet-tanaffos we nesbet el-oksigeen.","en":"Some monitor his heart rate, breathing and oxygen saturation."},{"n":5,"who":"Father","ar":"هو بيتغذى إزاي؟","lat":"Howwa beyetghazza ezzay?","en":"How is he being fed?"},{"n":6,"who":"NICU nurse","ar":"حالياً الفريق محدد طريقة تغذية تناسب حالته.","lat":"Haleyan el-faree' mehadded taree'et taghzeya tenaseb halto.","en":"The team has chosen a feeding method appropriate for his condition at present."},{"n":7,"who":"Mother","ar":"ينفع ألمسه أو أحضنه؟","lat":"Yenfa' almeso aw ahdono?","en":"May I touch or hold him?"},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنراجع مع الممرضة إمتى وإزاي يبقى ده آمن ليه.","lat":"Hanerage' ma'a el-momarrida emta we ezzay yeb'a da amen leeh.","en":"We'll check with the nurse when and how that can be safe for him."},{"n":9,"who":"Father","ar":"إمتى يقدر يخرج؟","lat":"Emta ye'dar yekhrog?","en":"When might he be discharged?"},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مش هنحدد يوم قبل ما نتأكد من استقرار حالته.","lat":"Mesh hanhadded yom abl ma net'akked men este'rar halto.","en":"We won't set a date until we're sure he's stable."},{"n":11,"who":"Mother","ar":"ساعات بخاف أسأل كتير.","lat":"Sa'at bakhaf as'al keteer.","en":"Sometimes I'm afraid to ask too many questions."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"اسألي براحتك؛ من حقك تفهمي كل خطوة.","lat":"Es'ali berahtek; men ha'ek tefhami kol khotwa.","en":"Please ask freely; you have a right to understand every step."},{"n":13,"who":"NICU nurse","ar":"هنكتب لكم تحديث الحالة وموعد الكلام مع الفريق.","lat":"Hanekteb lakom tahdees el-hala we me'ad el-kalam ma'a el-faree'.","en":"We'll document an update and when you can speak with the team."}],"scenario":"NICU care, monitoring, uncertainty and family support (context: Father, Mother, NICU nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L17","module":9,"lesson":17,"unit":5,"title":"Growth and Nutrition","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Child","arc":"Growth trend, intake, selective eating, family counselling","objectives":"Explore diet without blame; explain growth charts and referrals; check social context.","roleplay":"Parent says “my child is too thin” despite unknown trends; seek measurements and prior records.","caution":"Growth assessment uses serial age-appropriate measures, not a single weight alone.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إيه اللي مقلق حضرتك في أكله؟","lat":"Eh elli me'alla' hadretik fi aklo?","en":"What's concerning you about his eating?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"مش بيحب غير رز ومكرونة.","lat":"Mesh beyhebb gheir rozz we makarona.","en":"He likes only rice and pasta."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"من إمتى وهو بينقي الأكل كده؟","lat":"Men emta we howwa beyna''i el-akl keda?","en":"Since when has he been picky about food?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"من حوالي سنة.","lat":"Men hawalei sana.","en":"For about a year."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بياكل قد إيه في اليوم؟ وبيشرب إيه؟","lat":"Beyakol add eh fil-yom? We beyishrab eh?","en":"How much does he eat daily, and what does he drink?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"وجبات صغيرة وعصير كتير.","lat":"Wagabat soghayyara we aseer keteer.","en":"Small meals and lots of juice."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بيحصل كحة أو شرقة وهو بياكل؟","lat":"Beyehsal kohha aw shar'a we howwa beyakol?","en":"Does he cough or choke while eating?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، بس بيرفض يجرب حاجات جديدة.","lat":"La', bas beyerfod yegarrab hagat gedeeda.","en":"No, but he refuses to try new foods."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"معانا قياسات الوزن والطول القديمة؟","lat":"Ma'ana eyasat el-wazn wet-tool el-adeema?","en":"Do we have his previous weight and height measurements?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"في كراسة المتابعة.","lat":"Fi kurraset el-motaba'a.","en":"They're in his follow-up booklet."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممتاز، هنراجع منحنى النمو مش رقم واحد بس.","lat":"Momtaz, hanerage' monhana en-nomow mesh ra'am wahed bas.","en":"Great, we'll review his growth curve, not just one number."},{"n":12,"who":"Child","ar":"أنا مش بحب الخضار.","lat":"Ana mesh bahebb el-khodar.","en":"I don't like vegetables."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاهمة، خلينا نسأل إيه الأكلات اللي بتحبها ونبني عليها.","lat":"Fahma, khallina nes'al eh el-aklat elli betehebbaha we nebni aleiha.","en":"I understand; let's start with foods you like and build from there."},{"n":14,"who":"Mother","ar":"محتاجين أخصائي تغذية؟","lat":"Mehtageen akhessa'i taghzeya?","en":"Do we need a dietitian?"},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنشوف القياسات والتاريخ الأول، ولو مناسب هنرتب إحالة.","lat":"Haneshoof el-eyasat wet-tareekh el-awwel, we law monaseb hanratteb ehala.","en":"We'll review measurements and history first, then arrange a referral if appropriate."}],"scenario":"Growth trend, intake, selective eating, family counselling (context: Mother, Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L18","module":9,"lesson":18,"unit":5,"title":"Childhood Vaccinations","speakers":"Doctor, Father, Nurse","arc":"Record review, concerns, missed appointments, consent","objectives":"Ask about documentation, prior reactions and schedule concerns without giving a one-size-fits-all schedule.","roleplay":"Parent distrusts vaccines due to a relative's story; respond empathetically and offer reliable local guidance.","caution":"Immunization schedules and eligibility depend on country, age, prior doses, and clinical status; verify the current local schedule.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مع حضرتك كارت التطعيمات؟","lat":"Ma'a hadretak kart et-ta'teemat?","en":"Do you have the vaccination card?"},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"أيوه، بس فاتنا ميعاد آخر تطعيم.","lat":"Aywa, bas fatna me'ad akher ta'teem.","en":"Yes, but we missed the last vaccine appointment."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"كويس إنك جبت الكارت؛ هنراجع الجرعات اللي اتاخدت.","lat":"Kowayyes ennak gebt el-kart; hanerage' el-gor'at elli etakhadet.","en":"It's good you brought it; we'll review the recorded doses."},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"لازم نبدأ من الأول؟","lat":"Lazem nebda men el-awwel?","en":"Do we have to start over?"},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنحدد المطلوب حسب سنه وسجل التطعيمات والجدول المعتمد هنا.","lat":"Hanhadded el-matloob hasab senno we segel et-ta'teemat wel-gadwal el-mo'tamad hena.","en":"We'll determine what is needed using his age, records, and the local schedule."},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"أنا قلقان من الأعراض الجانبية.","lat":"Ana al'an men el-a'rad el-ganabeyya.","en":"I'm worried about side effects."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قلقك مفهوم؛ إيه بالضبط اللي سمعته أو شفته؟","lat":"Ala'ak mafhoom; eh bez-zabt elli seme'to aw shofto?","en":"That's understandable. What exactly have you heard or seen?"},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"ابن أخويا سخن بعد تطعيم.","lat":"Ebn akhoya sekhen ba'd ta'teem.","en":"My nephew had a fever after a vaccine."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بعض التفاعلات ممكن تحصل، وهنشرح المتوقع وعلامات الخطر للتطعيم المحدد.","lat":"Ba'd et-tafa'olat momken tehsal, we haneshrah el-motawaqqa' we alamat el-khatar lit-ta'teem el-mohadded.","en":"Some reactions can occur; we'll explain what to expect and the warning signs for this specific vaccine."},{"n":10,"who":"Nurse","ar":"هل حصل لابنك رد فعل شديد قبل كده؟","lat":"Hal hasal le-ebnak radd fe'l shadeed abl keda?","en":"Has your son had a severe reaction before?"},{"n":11,"who":"Father","ar":"لأ، عمره ما حصل.","lat":"La', omro ma hasal.","en":"No, never."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنتأكد من التاريخ والحالة الصحية قبل إعطاء أي جرعة.","lat":"Hanet'akked men et-tareekh wel-hala es-sehheyya abl e'ta' ay gor'a.","en":"We'll check his history and health before any dose."},{"n":13,"who":"Father","ar":"وبعد التطعيم أراقب إيه؟","lat":"We ba'd et-ta'teem ara'eb eh?","en":"What should I watch for afterward?"},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هتاخد تعليمات خاصة بالتطعيم، وإمتى تطلب مساعدة عاجلة.","lat":"Hatakhod ta'leemat khassa bet-ta'teem, we emta tetlob mosa'ada agela.","en":"You'll receive vaccine-specific instructions and guidance on when to seek urgent help."}],"scenario":"Record review, concerns, missed appointments, consent (context: Father, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L19","module":9,"lesson":19,"unit":5,"title":"Developmental Milestones","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father","arc":"Speech, hearing, social and motor milestones","objectives":"Use open questions about developmental progress; discuss referral without labeling prematurely.","roleplay":"Parent compares siblings; explore hearing, language exposure, regression and functional skills sensitively.","caution":"Loss of previously acquired skills requires prompt clinical attention; language needs may differ in multilingual homes.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إيه اللي ملاحظينه في كلام بنتكم؟","lat":"Eh elli molahezino fi kalam bentkom?","en":"What have you noticed about your daughter's speech?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"عندها سنتين ونص، وكلامها قليل.","lat":"Andaha sanatein we noss, we kalamha aleel.","en":"She's two and a half and doesn't say much."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بتفهم التعليمات البسيطة؟","lat":"Betefham et-ta'leemat el-baseeta?","en":"Does she understand simple instructions?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"آه، لما نقول هاتي الكورة بتجيبها.","lat":"Ah, lamma ne'ool hati el-kora betgeebha.","en":"Yes, if we say bring the ball, she brings it."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بتشاور على الحاجة اللي عايزاها؟","lat":"Beteshawer ala el-haga elli ayzaha?","en":"Does she point to what she wants?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، بس مش بتقول اسمها.","lat":"Aywa, bas mesh bete'ool esmaha.","en":"Yes, but she doesn't say its name."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هل كانت بتقول كلمات وبطلت؟","lat":"Hal kanet bete'ool kalemat we battalet?","en":"Did she used to say words and stop?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، هي بس بتتعلم ببطء.","lat":"La', heyya bas betet'allem be-bot'.","en":"No, she's just learning slowly."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"سمعها اتفحص قبل كده؟","lat":"Sam'aha etfahas abl keda?","en":"Has her hearing been checked?"},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"بعد الولادة بس.","lat":"Ba'd el-welada bas.","en":"Only after birth."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"وبتسمع لغات مختلفة في البيت؟","lat":"We betesma' loghat mokhtalefa fil-beit?","en":"Does she hear different languages at home?"},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، عربي وإنجليزي.","lat":"Aywa, arabi we englizi.","en":"Yes, Arabic and English."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ده جزء من الصورة، وهنراجع النمو والسمع والتواصل مع بعض.","lat":"Da goz' men es-sora, we hanerage' en-nomow wes-sam' wet-tawasul ma'a ba'd.","en":"That's part of the picture. We'll review development, hearing, and communication together."},{"n":14,"who":"Father","ar":"محتاجين أخصائي تخاطب؟","lat":"Mehtageen akhessa'i takhatob?","en":"Do we need a speech therapist?"},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن، بعد التقييم هنشرح أي إحالات مناسبة وسببها.","lat":"Momken, ba'd et-ta'yeem haneshrah ay ehalat monaseba we sababha.","en":"Possibly. After assessment, we'll explain any appropriate referrals and why."}],"scenario":"Speech, hearing, social and motor milestones (context: Mother, Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L20","module":9,"lesson":20,"unit":5,"title":"Adolescents and Sensitive Consultations","speakers":"Doctor, Teen, Mother","arc":"Privacy, respectful questions, confidentiality limits","objectives":"Speak directly to teen; seek private time routinely; explain confidentiality and safeguarding boundaries.","roleplay":"Teen shares a sensitive concern with parent present; use a private segment and avoid promising absolute secrecy.","caution":"Confidentiality and consent are jurisdiction-dependent; urgent safeguarding concerns may require disclosure.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أهلاً يا نور، تحبي أناديكي بإيه؟","lat":"Ahlan ya Nour, tehebbi anadiki be-eh?","en":"Hello Nour, what would you like me to call you?"},{"n":2,"who":"Teen","ar":"نور كويس.","lat":"Nour kowayyes.","en":"Nour is fine."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عايزة أسمع منك إنتِ الأول إيه اللي مضايقك.","lat":"Ayza asma' mennik enti el-awwel eh elli medaye'ek.","en":"I'd like to hear from you first about what's bothering you."},{"n":4,"who":"Teen","ar":"بقالي فترة متوترة ومش بنام كويس.","lat":"Ba'ali fatra metwattara we mesh banam kowayyes.","en":"I've felt anxious for a while and haven't slept well."},{"n":5,"who":"Mother","ar":"أنا كمان لاحظت إنها منعزلة.","lat":"Ana kaman lahezt ennaha mon'azela.","en":"I've noticed she's withdrawn too."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكراً. في السن ده بنخصص وقت نتكلم فيه مع المراهق لوحده.","lat":"Shokran. Fis-senn da benkhasses wa't netkallem fih ma'a el-morahe' lewahdo.","en":"Thank you. At this age we routinely spend some time talking with teenagers alone."},{"n":7,"who":"Mother","ar":"يعني أستنا برّه؟","lat":"Ya'ni astanna barra?","en":"Should I wait outside?"},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لو مناسب لحضرتك، وبعدين هنرجع نتكلم سوا في اللي نور توافق عليه.","lat":"Law monaseb le-hadretik, we ba'dein hanerga' netkallem sawa fil-li Nour tewafe' aleih.","en":"If that's okay, then we'll regroup about what Nour agrees to share."},{"n":9,"who":"Teen","ar":"الكلام بينا سرّي؟","lat":"El-kalam benna serri?","en":"Is what I say confidential?"},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنحترم خصوصيتك حسب القواعد هنا، لكن لو فيه خطر على سلامتك لازم نتصرف ونشرحلك.","lat":"Han-ehtarem khososiytek hasab el-awa'ed hena, lakin law fee khatar ala salamtik lazem netasarraf we neshrahlik.","en":"We'll respect your privacy under local rules, but if there's a safety risk we must act and explain that to you."},{"n":11,"who":"Teen","ar":"طيب، أنا محتاجة أتكلم عن المدرسة.","lat":"Tayyeb, ana mehtaga atkallem an el-madrasa.","en":"Okay, I need to talk about school."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"خدي وقتك؛ إيه أصعب حاجة في المدرسة دلوقتي؟","lat":"Khodi wa'tik; eh as'ab haga fil-madrasa delwa'ti?","en":"Take your time. What's hardest at school right now?"},{"n":13,"who":"Teen","ar":"حاسة إني مضغوطة طول الوقت.","lat":"Hassa enni madghoota tool el-wa't.","en":"I feel under pressure all the time."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكراً إنك قلتيلي؛ هنسمع باقي القصة ونفكر في الدعم المناسب.","lat":"Shokran enniki oltilli; hanesma' ba'i el-essa we nefakkar fid-da'm el-monasib.","en":"Thanks for telling me. Let's hear the rest and consider appropriate support."}],"scenario":"Privacy, respectful questions, confidentiality limits (context: Teen, Mother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L21","module":9,"lesson":21,"unit":6,"title":"Childhood Asthma","speakers":"Doctor, Father, Child, Nurse","arc":"Triggers, inhaler technique, action plan","objectives":"Ask about symptom frequency, triggers, activity and past severe episodes; explain review and device technique.","roleplay":"Father uses an inhaler without spacer; invite demonstration and correct technique with trained staff.","caution":"Emergency breathing symptoms override routine asthma teaching; individualized treatment follows clinical protocols.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الكحة أو الصفير بيظهروا في أوقات معينة؟","lat":"El-kohha aw es-safeer beyezharu fi aw'at mo'ayyana?","en":"Does coughing or wheezing happen at certain times?"},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"لما يجري أو الجو يبقى تراب.","lat":"Lamma yegri aw el-gaww yeb'a torab.","en":"When he runs or it's dusty."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"وبيصحى بالليل بسبب النفس؟","lat":"We beyes'ha belleil besabab en-nafas?","en":"Does breathing wake him at night?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"آه، مرتين الأسبوع ده.","lat":"Ah, marratein el-esboo' da.","en":"Yes, twice this week."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"محتاج يستخدم بخاخ الإنقاذ كتير؟","lat":"Mehtag yestakhdem bakhakh el-en'az keteer?","en":"Does he need his reliever inhaler often?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"أكتر من الأول.","lat":"Aktar mel-awwel.","en":"More than before."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن توريني بتستخدموا البخاخ إزاي؟","lat":"Momken tewarreeni betestakhdemu el-bakhakh ezzay?","en":"Can you show me how you use the inhaler?"},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"بنرشه في بقه بسرعة.","lat":"Benresho fi bo'o besor'a.","en":"We spray it into his mouth quickly."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنراجع الطريقة والجهاز المناسب مع الممرضة.","lat":"Hanerage' et-taree'a wel-gehaz el-monasib ma'a el-momarrida.","en":"We'll review technique and the right device with the nurse."},{"n":10,"who":"Child","ar":"أنا عايز ألعب كورة.","lat":"Ana ayiz al'ab kora.","en":"I want to play football."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هدفنا إنك تلعب بأمان وتتنفس كويس.","lat":"Hadafna ennak tel'ab be-aman we tetnaffes kowayyes.","en":"Our goal is for you to play safely and breathe well."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"ولو حصلت نوبة في البيت؟","lat":"We law hasalet nawba fil-beit?","en":"What if he has an attack at home?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنعمل خطة مكتوبة لحالته: إمتى يستخدم العلاج وإمتى يطلب مساعدة عاجلة.","lat":"Hana'mel khotta maktooba le-halto: emta yestakhdem el-elag we emta yetlob mosa'ada agela.","en":"We'll make an individualized written plan covering treatment and when to seek urgent help."},{"n":14,"who":"Nurse","ar":"وهنخليك تشرح لنا الطريقة عشان نتأكد إنها واضحة.","lat":"We hanekhalleek teshrahlena et-taree'a ashan net'akked ennaha wadha.","en":"We'll have you explain the technique back so we know it's clear."}],"scenario":"Triggers, inhaler technique, action plan (context: Father, Child, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L22","module":9,"lesson":22,"unit":6,"title":"Allergies, Eczema and Food Reactions","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father","arc":"Temporal relationship, severity, trigger avoidance","objectives":"Clarify timing, reaction type, treatment history and emergency symptoms; avoid unproven food bans.","roleplay":"Family reports a rash after food and fears every ingredient; distinguish suspected from confirmed allergy.","caution":"Suspected anaphylaxis demands emergency response; food challenges must not be improvised at home.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إيه اللي حصل بعد ما أكلت البنت؟","lat":"Eh elli hasal ba'd ma akalet el-bent?","en":"What happened after your daughter ate?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"طلع لها طفح حوالين بقها.","lat":"Tele' laha tafah hawalein bo'ha.","en":"A rash appeared around her mouth."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بعد الأكل بقد إيه؟","lat":"Ba'd el-akl be-add eh?","en":"How long after eating?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"في خلال نص ساعة تقريباً.","lat":"Fi khelal noss sa'a ta'reeban.","en":"Within about half an hour."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حصل تورم في اللسان أو الشفايف أو صعوبة تنفس؟","lat":"Hasal tawarrom fil-lesan aw esh-shefayef aw so'oobet tanaffos?","en":"Any tongue or lip swelling or breathing trouble?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"لأ، بس كانت بتحك جلدها.","lat":"La', bas kanet bethekk geldaha.","en":"No, but she was scratching her skin."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الأكل كان فيه إيه بالتحديد؟","lat":"El-akl kan feeh eh bet-tahdeed?","en":"What exactly was in the food?"},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"بيض ولبن ودقيق.","lat":"Beid we laban we de'ee'.","en":"Eggs, milk and flour."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مش هنفترض إن كل المكونات سبب المشكلة.","lat":"Mesh haneftered en kol el-mokawwenat sabab el-moshkela.","en":"We shouldn't assume every ingredient caused it."},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"نمنع عنها كل الحاجات دي؟","lat":"Nemna' anha kol el-hagat di?","en":"Should we stop all of those foods?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنراجع التاريخ ونحدد إذا محتاجة تقييم حساسية متخصص.","lat":"Hanerage' et-tareekh we nehadded eza mehtaga ta'yeem hassaseyya motakhasses.","en":"We'll review the history and decide if specialist allergy assessment is needed."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"ولو ظهر ضيق نفس بعد أكل؟","lat":"We law zahar dee' nafas ba'd akl?","en":"What if she develops breathing trouble after eating?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ده طارئ؛ اطلبوا مساعدة إسعافية فوراً واتبعوا خطة الطوارئ الموصوفة.","lat":"Da tare'; otlobo mosa'ada es'afeyya fawran we ettabe'o khottet et-taware' el-mawsoofa.","en":"That's an emergency; seek emergency help immediately and follow the prescribed emergency plan."},{"n":14,"who":"Mother","ar":"فهمنا، وهنكتب كل اللي حصل.","lat":"Fehemna, we hanekteb kol elli hasal.","en":"Understood; we'll record what happened."}],"scenario":"Temporal relationship, severity, trigger avoidance (context: Mother, Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L23","module":9,"lesson":23,"unit":6,"title":"Diabetes, Epilepsy and Long-Term Conditions","speakers":"Doctor, Teen, Mother, Nurse","arc":"Chronic treatment, monitoring, school support, escalation","objectives":"Ask about routines, missed medication, sick days and school plans; use nonjudgmental language.","roleplay":"Teen with epilepsy avoids school trips; build a communication plan involving caregiver and care team.","caution":"Emergency action plans and medication specifics must be individualized; no arbitrary doses.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أخبار المتابعة والعلاج معاكي إيه يا مريم؟","lat":"Akhbar el-motaba'a wel-elag ma'aki eh ya Mariam?","en":"How's follow-up and treatment going, Mariam?"},{"n":2,"who":"Teen","ar":"باخد العلاج، بس ساعات بنسى في المدرسة.","lat":"Bakhod el-elag, bas sa'at bansa fil-madrasa.","en":"I take it, but sometimes I forget at school."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إيه اللي بيصعّب الموضوع عليكي؟","lat":"Eh elli beysa''ab el-mawdoo' aleiki?","en":"What makes it difficult for you?"},{"n":4,"who":"Teen","ar":"مش عايزة أصحابي يعرفوا إني عندي صرع.","lat":"Mesh ayza ashabi ye'rafu enni andi sar'.","en":"I don't want my friends to know I have epilepsy."},{"n":5,"who":"Mother","ar":"وأنا خايفة عليها في الرحلات.","lat":"We ana khayfa aleiha fir-rehlat.","en":"And I'm worried about school trips."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مفهوم، ونقدر نناقش خطة أمان تحافظ على خصوصيتها قد الإمكان.","lat":"Mafhoom, we ne'dar nena'esh khottet aman tehafez ala khososiyetha add el-emkan.","en":"I understand. We can discuss a safety plan that protects her privacy as far as possible."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"آخر نوبة كانت إمتى واستمرت قد إيه؟","lat":"Akher nawba kanet emta we estammarret add eh?","en":"When was the last seizure and how long did it last?"},{"n":8,"who":"Teen","ar":"من شهر تقريباً، وماما كانت معايا.","lat":"Men shahr ta'reeban, we mama kanet ma'aya.","en":"About a month ago; Mom was with me."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هل في آثار جانبية مضايقاكي من العلاج؟","lat":"Hal fi athar ganabeyya medaye'aki men el-elag?","en":"Any medication side effects bothering you?"},{"n":10,"who":"Teen","ar":"ساعات بدوخ.","lat":"Sa'at badookh.","en":"Sometimes I feel dizzy."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنراجع العلاج مع الفريق من غير ما نغيّره من نفسنا.","lat":"Hanerage' el-elag ma'a el-faree' men gheir ma neghayyaro men nafsena.","en":"We'll review treatment with the team without changing it on our own."},{"n":12,"who":"Nurse","ar":"وهنراجع خطة المدرسة والتصرف وقت الطوارئ.","lat":"We hanerage' khottet el-madrasa wet-tasarruf wa't et-taware'.","en":"We'll review the school plan and emergency response."},{"n":13,"who":"Mother","ar":"ممكن نكتب الخطة للمدرسة؟","lat":"Momken nekteb el-khotta lel-madrasa?","en":"Can we put the plan in writing for school?"},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"طبعاً، حسب الحالة وموافقة الأسرة والقواعد المعمول بيها.","lat":"Tab'an, hasab el-hala we mowafa'et el-osra wel-awa'ed el-ma'mool beeha.","en":"Of course, based on the case, family agreement and applicable rules."}],"scenario":"Chronic treatment, monitoring, school support, escalation (context: Teen, Mother, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L24","module":9,"lesson":24,"unit":6,"title":"Developmental Disabilities and Complex Care","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father, Child","arc":"Inclusive communication, supports, multidisciplinary planning","objectives":"Speak to the child directly; ask caregivers about communication preferences; respect routines and access needs.","roleplay":"Nonverbal child uses gestures; invite the family's guidance rather than talking over the child.","caution":"Never conflate a communication disability with lack of understanding or decision-making capacity.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ابنكم بيحب نتكلم معاه إزاي؟","lat":"Ebnekom beyhebb netkallem ma'ah ezzay?","en":"How does your son prefer us to communicate with him?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"بيفهم كلام كتير، بس بيستخدم صور عشان يرد.","lat":"Beyefham kalam keteer, bas beyestakhdem sowar ashan yerodd.","en":"He understands a lot but uses pictures to respond."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممتاز، ينفع نشوف الصور اللي بيستخدمها؟","lat":"Momtaz, yenfa' neshoof es-sowar elli beyestakhdemha?","en":"Great. May we see the pictures he uses?"},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"أيوه، عندنا كراسة معاه.","lat":"Aywa, andena kurrasa ma'ah.","en":"Yes, we brought his picture book."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا علي، هديك وقت تختار الصورة اللي بتوضح إحساسك.","lat":"Ya Ali, haddeek wa't tekhtar es-sora elli betwaddah ehsasak.","en":"Ali, I'll give you time to pick the picture showing how you feel."},{"n":6,"who":"Child","ar":"[يشاور على صورة بطن]","lat":"[Yeshawer ala soret batn]","en":"[Points to a picture of a tummy.]"},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكراً يا علي، فهمت إن بطنك مضايقاك.","lat":"Shokran ya Ali, fehemt en batnak medaye'ak.","en":"Thank you, Ali; I understand your tummy bothers you."},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"هو بيتوتر من الأماكن الزحمة.","lat":"Howwa beyitwattar mel-amaken ez-zahma.","en":"Crowded places make him anxious."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"نقدر نحاول نخلي المكان أهدى ونشرح كل خطوة قبلها.","lat":"Ne'dar nehawel nekhalle el-makan ahda we neshrah kol khotwa ablha.","en":"We can try to make the room quieter and explain each step in advance."},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"عنده مواعيد مع أكتر من تخصص.","lat":"Ando mawa'eed ma'a aktar men takhassos.","en":"He has appointments with several specialties."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مين المسؤول عن تنسيق خطة الرعاية دلوقتي؟","lat":"Meen el-mas'ool an tansee' khottet er-re'aya delwa'ti?","en":"Who currently coordinates his care plan?"},{"n":12,"who":"Mother","ar":"إحنا بنحاول ننسق بينهم.","lat":"Ehna benhawel nenassa' benhom.","en":"We're trying to coordinate between them."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"خلينا نراجع التقارير ونتفق على طريقة واضحة للتواصل بين الفرق.","lat":"Khallina nerage' et-ta'areer we nettafe' ala taree'a wadha lit-tawasul ben el-fora'.","en":"Let's review the reports and agree on clear communication between teams."}],"scenario":"Inclusive communication, supports, multidisciplinary planning (context: Mother, Father, Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L25","module":9,"lesson":25,"unit":7,"title":"Explaining a Diagnosis","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father","arc":"Uncertainty, differential, result interpretation, teach-back","objectives":"Distinguish suspected and confirmed conditions; explain investigations in plain language; invite questions.","roleplay":"A worried father wants a definite answer before tests; be clear about what is known and unknown.","caution":"Don't present a hypothetical diagnosis as established; link all clinical decisions to findings and review.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"خلينا نراجع اللي عرفناه لحد دلوقتي.","lat":"Khallina nerage' elli 'erifnah le-hadd delwa'ti.","en":"Let's review what we know so far."},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"يعني إيه التشخيص؟","lat":"Ya'ni eh et-tashkhees?","en":"So what's the diagnosis?"},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الأعراض والكشف بيخلونا نفكر في أكتر من سبب.","lat":"El-a'rad wel-kashf biyekhalloona nefakkar fi aktar men sabab.","en":"The symptoms and examination suggest more than one possible cause."},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"يعني مش متأكدين؟","lat":"Ya'ni mesh meta'akkedeen?","en":"So you're not sure?"},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لسه، وعايزة أكون واضحة في اللي نعرفه واللي محتاجين نتأكد منه.","lat":"Lessa, we ayza akoon wadha fil-li ne'rafo wel-li mehtageen net'akked menno.","en":"Not yet. I want to be clear about what we know and what we still need to check."},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"ممكن يكون مرض خطير؟","lat":"Momken yekoon marad khateer?","en":"Could it be something serious?"},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بنقيّم الاحتمالات المهمة الأول عشان ما نفوّتش حاجة عاجلة.","lat":"Ben'ayyem el-ehtemalat el-mohemma el-awwel ashan ma nefawwetsh haga agela.","en":"We assess important possibilities first so we don't miss anything urgent."},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"هنحتاج تحاليل؟","lat":"Hanehtag tahaleel?","en":"Will tests be needed?"},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن، وهشرح كل تحليل هيجاوب على سؤال إيه.","lat":"Momken, we hashrah kol tahleel haygawab ala so'al eh.","en":"Possibly, and I'll explain what question each test answers."},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"ولو التحاليل طلعت طبيعية؟","lat":"We law et-tahaleel tel'et tabee'eyya?","en":"What if the tests are normal?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنربطها بالحالة، وممكن نحتاج متابعة أو إعادة تقييم.","lat":"Hanerbot-ha bel-hala, we momken nehtag motaba'a aw e'adet ta'yeem.","en":"We'll interpret them in context; follow-up or reassessment may still be needed."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"طيب نعمل إيه دلوقتي؟","lat":"Tayyeb ne'mel eh delwa'ti?","en":"What do we do now?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الخطوة الجاية هي التقييم اللي اتفقنا عليه، وبعده نراجع النتائج سوا.","lat":"El-khotwa el-gayya heyya et-ta'yeem elli ettafa'na aleih, we ba'do nerage' en-natayeg sawa.","en":"The next step is the assessment we discussed, then we'll review the results together."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن تقولولي فهمتوا إيه لحد هنا؟","lat":"Momken te'oolooli fehemtu eh le-hadd hena?","en":"Could you tell me what you've understood so far?"}],"scenario":"Uncertainty, differential, result interpretation, teach-back (context: Mother, Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L26","module":9,"lesson":26,"unit":7,"title":"Prescribing and Explaining Medicines","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Pharmacist","arc":"Weight, concentration, timing, measuring, missed dose, adverse effects","objectives":"Confirm prescription and caregiver comprehension; distinguish mL and mg; discuss adverse reactions and safe storage.","roleplay":"Caregiver has two differently concentrated bottles; identify discrepancy and reconcile before any administration.","caution":"Never infer pediatric doses from example dialogue. Dose, formulation, contraindications and age appropriateness require independent clinical verification.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قبل ما نتكلم عن الدوا، محتاجة الوزن الحالي والحساسية والأدوية التانية.","lat":"Abl ma netkallem an ed-dawa, mehtaga el-wazn el-hali wel-hassaseyya wel-adweya et-tanya.","en":"Before discussing the medicine, I need current weight, allergies and other medicines."},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"وزنه اتقاس النهارده، وعندي صورتين لعلبتين.","lat":"Wazno et'as ennaharda, we andi sortein le-elbetein.","en":"He was weighed today, and I have pictures of two boxes."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الصورتين لنفس اسم الدوا لكن التركيز مختلف.","lat":"Es-sortein le-nafs esm ed-dawa, lakin et-tarkeez mokhtalef.","en":"They're the same drug name but different concentrations."},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"ينفع أستخدم أي واحدة؟","lat":"Yenfa' astakhdem ay wahda?","en":"Can I use either one?"},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لأ، لازم نتأكد من التركيز المكتوب قبل ما نحدد الحجم بالملي.","lat":"La', lazem net'akked men et-tarkeez el-maktoob abl ma nehadded el-hagm bel-milli.","en":"No. We must confirm the labeled concentration before specifying the volume in milliliters."},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"أقيس الجرعة بالمعلقة؟","lat":"A'ees el-gor'a bel-ma'la'a?","en":"Should I measure the dose with a spoon?"},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"استخدمي سرنجة فموية مدرّجة، مش معلقة من المطبخ.","lat":"Estakhdemi serenga famaweyya modarraga, mesh ma'la'a mel-matbakh.","en":"Use a marked oral syringe, not a kitchen spoon."},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"والدواء كل كام ساعة؟","lat":"Wed-dawa kol kam sa'a?","en":"How often is the medicine given?"},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"التعليمات الخاصة بالدواء ده مكتوبة هنا، وهنراجعها مع بعض.","lat":"Et-ta'leemat el-khassa bed-dawa da maktooba hena, we hanerage'ha ma'a ba'd.","en":"This medicine's specific instructions are written here; we'll review them together."},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"ولو نسيت جرعة؟","lat":"We law neseet gor'a?","en":"What if I miss a dose?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ما تضاعفيش الجرعة من نفسك؛ ارجعي لتعليمات الدوا أو اسألي الصيدلي.","lat":"Ma teda'feesh el-gor'a men nafsik; erga'i le-ta'leemat ed-dawa aw es'ali es-saydali.","en":"Don't double the dose yourself; consult the medicine instructions or pharmacist."},{"n":12,"who":"Pharmacist","ar":"خليني أتأكد إن حضرتك معاكي العبوة والتركيز الصح.","lat":"Khallini at'akked en hadretik ma'aki el-'obwa wet-tarkeez es-sahh.","en":"Let me verify you have the correct bottle and concentration."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ولو ظهر تفاعل غير معتاد أو أعراض خطيرة، اطلبوا مساعدة فوراً.","lat":"We law zahar tafa'ol gheir mo'tad aw a'rad khateera, otlobo mosa'ada fawran.","en":"Seek prompt help if an unusual reaction or serious symptoms appear."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن توريني هتقيسي الدوا إزاي؟","lat":"Momken tewarreeni hate'eesi ed-dawa ezzay?","en":"Can you show me how you'll measure the medicine?"},{"n":15,"who":"Mother","ar":"بالسرنجة وعلى حسب المكتوب، وبعد ما نتأكد من التركيز.","lat":"Bes-serenga we ala hasab el-maktoob, we ba'd ma net'akked men et-tarkeez.","en":"With the syringe as written, after verifying the concentration."}],"scenario":"Weight, concentration, timing, measuring, missed dose, adverse effects (context: Mother, Pharmacist)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L27","module":9,"lesson":27,"unit":7,"title":"Tests, Injections and Procedures","speakers":"Doctor, Father, Child, Nurse","arc":"Preparation, informed assent, honest pain explanation, results","objectives":"Explain why tests are considered; prepare child without false promises; check guardian authorization as applicable.","roleplay":"Child fears blood draw; coordinate with nurse and parent, use distraction and honest explanation.","caution":"Procedure decisions, pain control and consent must follow institution policy.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"محتاجين نشرح لكم ليه بنفكر في تحليل دم.","lat":"Mehtageen neshrah lakom leh benefakkar fi tahleel dam.","en":"We need to explain why we're considering a blood test."},{"n":2,"who":"Father","ar":"التحليل هيوضح إيه؟","lat":"Et-tahleel haywaddah eh?","en":"What will the test show?"},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بيساعدنا نجاوب على أسئلة محددة، ومش لوحده بيحدد التشخيص.","lat":"Beysa'edna negawab ala as'ela mohaddada, we mesh lewahdo bey-hadded et-tashkhees.","en":"It helps answer specific questions and won't establish a diagnosis on its own."},{"n":4,"who":"Child","ar":"هيعملوا فيا إيه؟","lat":"Haya'melo fiyya eh?","en":"What are they going to do to me?"},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الممرضة هتاخد عينة صغيرة من الدم من إيدك.","lat":"El-momarrida hatakhod ayyna soghayyara med-dam men eedak.","en":"The nurse will take a small blood sample from your arm."},{"n":6,"who":"Child","ar":"هتوجع؟","lat":"Hatewga'?","en":"Will it hurt?"},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن تحس بوخزة صغيرة، وهنساعدك تكون مرتاح على قد ما نقدر.","lat":"Momken tehess be-wakhza soghayyara, we hanesa'edak tekoon mertah ala add ma ne'dar.","en":"You may feel a little prick; we'll help you be as comfortable as possible."},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"ينفع أفضل معاه؟","lat":"Yenfa' afdal ma'ah?","en":"Can I stay with him?"},{"n":9,"who":"Nurse","ar":"غالباً ينفع، وهنقول لك تقف فين عشان نشتغل بأمان.","lat":"Ghaleban yenfa', we han'ollak te'ef fein ashan neshtaghal be-aman.","en":"Usually yes; we'll show you where to stand so we can work safely."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تحب تبص الناحية التانية وتعد مع بابا؟","lat":"Tehebb teboss en-naheya et-tanya we te'odd ma'a baba?","en":"Would you like to look away and count with Dad?"},{"n":11,"who":"Child","ar":"أيوه، هنعد للعشرة.","lat":"Aywa, han'odd lel-ashara.","en":"Yes, let's count to ten."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"النتيجة هتطلع إمتى؟","lat":"En-nateega hatetla' emta?","en":"When will the result come back?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنتأكد من المعمل ونبلغكم بميعاد واضح.","lat":"Hanet'akked mel-ma'mal we nballaghkom be-me'ad wadeh.","en":"We'll confirm with the lab and give you a clear time."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ولو احتجنا إجراء تاني، هنشرح السبب ونطلب الموافقة المناسبة.","lat":"We law ehtagna egra' tani, haneshrah es-sabab we netlob el-mowafa'a el-monasba.","en":"If another procedure is needed, we'll explain why and obtain appropriate consent."}],"scenario":"Preparation, informed assent, honest pain explanation, results (context: Father, Child, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L28","module":9,"lesson":28,"unit":7,"title":"Treatment Decisions and Difficult Conversations","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father, Senior doctor","arc":"Disagreement, uncertainty, shared decisions, breaking difficult news","objectives":"Acknowledge emotions; explain options and risks; check preferences and decision authority; communicate unwelcome findings sensitively.","roleplay":"Parents disagree about admission; invite each concern and propose specialist-supported decision-making.","caution":"Serious news, refusal of essential care, and safeguarding require senior support and local policy.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"محتاجة أتكلم معاكم بهدوء عن نتيجة الكشف.","lat":"Mehtaga atkallem ma'akum be-hodoo' an nateegat el-kashf.","en":"I need to talk with you calmly about the examination findings."},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"قلقانة جداً، في حاجة خطيرة؟","lat":"Al'ana geddan, fi haga khateera?","en":"I'm very worried. Is it serious?"},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه نتيجة مقلقة وعايزة أوضح معناها والخطوات الممكنة.","lat":"Feeh nateega me'alle'a we ayza awaddah ma'naha wel-khotawat el-momkena.","en":"There's a concerning finding. I want to explain what it means and the possible next steps."},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"أنا مش موافق يدخل المستشفى.","lat":"Ana mesh mowafe' yedkhol el-mostashfa.","en":"I don't agree to hospital admission."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن أفهم إيه أكتر حاجة مقلقاك من الدخول؟","lat":"Momken afham eh aktar haga me'alla'ak men ed-dokhool?","en":"Can I understand your main concern about admission?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"خايف يتعب نفسياً، وعندي شغل.","lat":"Khayef yet'ab nafseyyan, we andi shoghl.","en":"I'm worried about his distress, and I have work."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاهمة القلق ده، وخلينا نشرح ليه بنوصي بالمراقبة هنا.","lat":"Fahma el-ala' da, we khallina neshrah leh benwassi bel-mora'aba hena.","en":"I understand. Let me explain why we recommend observation here."},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"أنا عايزاه يفضل لو ده أأمن.","lat":"Ana ayzah yefdal law da a'aman.","en":"I want him to stay if that's safer."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"واضح إنكم الاتنين عايزين مصلحته.","lat":"Wadeh enkom el-etnein ayzeen maslahto.","en":"It's clear you both want what's best for him."},{"n":10,"who":"Father","ar":"فيه بديل آمن في البيت؟","lat":"Feeh badeel amen fil-beit?","en":"Is there a safe alternative at home?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنوضح فوائد ومخاطر كل اختيار، وإمتى البدائل ما تبقاش آمنة.","lat":"Hanwaddah fawayed we makhater kol ekhtiyar, we emta el-badayel ma teb'ash amna.","en":"We'll explain benefits and risks of each option and when alternatives aren't safe."},{"n":12,"who":"Senior doctor","ar":"نقدر نقعد كلنا ونراجع التوصية معاكم.","lat":"Ne'dar no'od kollena we nerage' et-tawseya ma'akum.","en":"We can all sit together and review the recommendation."},{"n":13,"who":"Mother","ar":"محتاجين شوية وقت نفهم.","lat":"Mehtageen shewayyet wa't nefham.","en":"We need some time to understand."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"طبعاً، وهنجاوب عن أسئلتكم من غير ما نأخر رعاية عاجلة.","lat":"Tab'an, we hangawab an as'eltokom men gheir ma ne'akhkhar re'aya agela.","en":"Of course; we'll answer questions without delaying urgent care."}],"scenario":"Disagreement, uncertainty, shared decisions, breaking difficult news (context: Mother, Father, Senior doctor)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L29","module":9,"lesson":29,"unit":8,"title":"Recognizing a Seriously Ill Child","speakers":"Mother, Doctor, Nurse","arc":"Urgent triage, altered responsiveness, circulation","objectives":"Recognize caregiver words for deterioration; request emergency help; give concise team summary.","roleplay":"Caregiver says the child is “just sleepy”; distinguish ordinary sleep from reduced responsiveness and escalate.","caution":"This is a communication rehearsal, not a resuscitation algorithm. Follow local emergency protocols.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Mother","ar":"ابني مش بيفتح عينه زي العادي.","lat":"Ebni mesh beyiftah eino zay el-adi.","en":"My son isn't opening his eyes as usual."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"من إمتى بقى صعب تصحّيه؟","lat":"Men emta be'a sa'b tesahhee?","en":"Since when has he been hard to wake?"},{"n":3,"who":"Mother","ar":"من نص ساعة تقريباً.","lat":"Men noss sa'a ta'reeban.","en":"About half an hour."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا سستر، محتاجين الفريق المسؤول عن الطوارئ حالاً.","lat":"Ya sister, mehtageen el-faree' el-mas'ool an et-taware' halan.","en":"Nurse, we need the emergency team immediately."},{"n":5,"who":"Nurse","ar":"هطلب المساعدة وهجهز الأجهزة.","lat":"Hatlob el-mosa'ada we hagahhez el-agheza.","en":"I'll call for help and prepare equipment."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"كان بيشرب أو بيتحرك قبل كده؟","lat":"Kan beyishrab aw beyitharrak abl keda?","en":"Was he drinking or moving earlier?"},{"n":7,"who":"Mother","ar":"الصبح كان بيلعب، وبعدين تعب بسرعة.","lat":"Es-sobh kan beyel'ab, we ba'dein te'eb besor'a.","en":"He was playing this morning, then deteriorated quickly."},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حصل تشنجات أو ترجيع شديد؟","lat":"Hasal tashannogat aw targee' shadeed?","en":"Any seizures or severe vomiting?"},{"n":9,"who":"Mother","ar":"رجّع مرتين، وما شربش بعدها.","lat":"Ragga' marratein, we ma sherebsh ba'daha.","en":"He vomited twice and hasn't drunk since."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنفحص التنفس والنبض والدورة الدموية فوراً.","lat":"Hanefhas et-tanaffos wen-nabd wed-dawra ed-damaweyya fawran.","en":"We'll immediately assess breathing, pulse and circulation."},{"n":11,"who":"Nurse","ar":"الفريق جاي، والعلامات الحيوية بنتابعها.","lat":"El-faree' gay, wel-alamat el-hayaweyya bentabe'aha.","en":"The team is coming; we're monitoring vital signs."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا مدام، هنسألك أسئلة قصيرة وإحنا بنهتم بيه.","lat":"Ya madam, hanes'alik as'ela aseera we ehna benehtamm beeh.","en":"We'll ask brief questions while we care for him."},{"n":13,"who":"Mother","ar":"حاضر، أنا جنبكم.","lat":"Hader, ana gambkom.","en":"Okay, I'm right here."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنتصرف بسرعة ونبلغك بكل خطوة مهمة.","lat":"Hanetasarraf besor'a we hanballaghik be-kol khotwa mohemma.","en":"We'll act quickly and update you on key steps."}],"scenario":"Urgent triage, altered responsiveness, circulation (context: Mother, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L30","module":9,"lesson":30,"unit":8,"title":"Respiratory Distress and Acute Wheezing","speakers":"Father, Doctor, Nurse, Consultant","arc":"Urgent breathing assessment; handover","objectives":"Describe respiratory distress succinctly; communicate response to initial assessment and family updates.","roleplay":"Child arrives with marked chest retractions; call team early and avoid delays for lengthy explanations.","caution":"Do not substitute a scripted nebulizer or oxygen protocol for clinician-directed emergency management.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Father","ar":"بنتي بتنهج ومش قادرة تتكلم جملة كاملة.","lat":"Benti betenhag we mesh adra tetkallem gomla kamla.","en":"My daughter is breathless and can't speak a full sentence."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"دي حالة طارئة؛ هنبدأ تقييم التنفس حالاً.","lat":"Di hala tare'a; hanebda ta'yeem et-tanaffos halan.","en":"This is an emergency; we'll assess breathing immediately."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا سستر، نادِي فريق الطوارئ من فضلك.","lat":"Ya sister, nadi faree' et-taware' men fadlik.","en":"Nurse, please call the emergency team."},{"n":4,"who":"Nurse","ar":"حاضر، الفريق في الطريق.","lat":"Hader, el-faree' fit-taree'.","en":"Yes, the team is on the way."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عندها تاريخ ربو أو حساسية شديدة؟","lat":"Andaha tareekh rabw aw hassaseyya shadeeda?","en":"Does she have asthma or severe allergies?"},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"عندها ربو، واستخدمنا بخاخها.","lat":"Andaha rabw, we estakhdemna bakhakhha.","en":"She has asthma, and we used her inhaler."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إمتى استخدمتوه؟ واسم البخاخ إيه؟","lat":"Emta estakhdemtooh? We esm el-bakhakh eh?","en":"When did you use it, and what is the inhaler's name?"},{"n":8,"who":"Father","ar":"من عشر دقايق، وجبت العلبة.","lat":"Men ashar da'aye', we gebt el-elba.","en":"Ten minutes ago; I brought the packaging."},{"n":9,"who":"Consultant","ar":"اديني ملخص سريع للحالة والعلامات الحيوية.","lat":"Eddeeni molakhkhas saree' lel-hala wel-alamat el-hayaweyya.","en":"Give me a quick summary of the case and vital signs."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"طفلة عندها ربو، ضيق نفس شديد وصعوبة في الكلام، وبنقيّم العلامات الحيوية دلوقتي.","lat":"Tefla andaha rabw, dee' nafas shadeed we so'ooba fil-kalam, we ben'ayyem el-alamat el-hayaweyya delwa'ti.","en":"A girl with asthma, severe breathlessness and difficulty speaking; we're checking vital signs now."},{"n":11,"who":"Consultant","ar":"تمام، هنكمل حسب بروتوكول الطوارئ ونراجع الاستجابة باستمرار.","lat":"Tamam, hanekammel hasab protokol et-taware' we nerage' el-estegaba bestemrar.","en":"Okay, we'll proceed under the emergency protocol and reassess response continually."},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"هتبقى كويسة؟","lat":"Hateb'a kowayyisa?","en":"Will she be okay?"},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الحالة جدية، والفريق بيعالجها دلوقتي؛ مش هديك وعد قبل ما نشوف استجابتها.","lat":"El-hala geddeyya, wel-faree' beye'alegha delwa'ti; mesh haddeek wa'd abl ma neshoof estegabetha.","en":"This is serious and the team is treating her now; I can't promise an outcome before we see her response."}],"scenario":"Urgent breathing assessment; handover (context: Father, Nurse, Consultant)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L31","module":9,"lesson":31,"unit":8,"title":"Seizures, Altered Consciousness and Severe Reactions","speakers":"Mother, Doctor, Nurse","arc":"Witness history, urgency, safety communication","objectives":"Gather essential seizure description; support parent and communicate emergency response without delay.","roleplay":"Parent describes shaking, blank stare and prolonged drowsiness; clarify timing and urgent next steps.","caution":"For severe allergic reactions or seizures follow local protocols, including escalation and emergency medications where indicated; do not improvise dosing.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Mother","ar":"ابني جسمه كله اتشد وبعدين بدأ يتهز.","lat":"Ebni gesmo kollo etshadd we ba'dein beda yethazz.","en":"My son's whole body stiffened, then started shaking."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"حصل ده إمتى؟ واستمر قد إيه تقريباً؟","lat":"Hasal da emta? We estammar add eh ta'reeban?","en":"When did it happen, and about how long did it last?"},{"n":3,"who":"Mother","ar":"حالاً، مش عارفة قد إيه بالضبط.","lat":"Halan, mesh arfa add eh bez-zabt.","en":"Just now; I don't know exactly how long."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"كان بيتنفس؟ ولون وشه اتغير؟","lat":"Kan beyitnaffes? We lawn wesho etghayyar?","en":"Was he breathing? Did his face change color?"},{"n":5,"who":"Mother","ar":"وشه بقى مزرق شوية.","lat":"Wesho be'a mezra' shewayya.","en":"His face looked a little bluish."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لازم تقييم طارئ فوراً. يا سستر، نادي الفريق.","lat":"Lazem ta'yeem tare' fawran. Ya sister, nadi el-faree'.","en":"He needs immediate emergency assessment. Nurse, call the team."},{"n":7,"who":"Nurse","ar":"الفريق اتبلغ.","lat":"El-faree' etballagh.","en":"The team has been alerted."},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"كان عنده حرارة أو نوبات قبل كده؟","lat":"Kan ando harara aw nawbat abl keda?","en":"Did he have a fever or previous seizures?"},{"n":9,"who":"Mother","ar":"كان سخن، بس عمره ما عمل كده.","lat":"Kan sekhen, bas omro ma amel keda.","en":"He had a fever, but this never happened before."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أخد أدوية أو أكل حاجة جديدة النهارده؟","lat":"Akhad adweya aw akal haga gedeeda ennaharda?","en":"Has he taken medicines or new food today?"},{"n":11,"who":"Mother","ar":"أخد الدوا اللي وصفه الدكتور الصبح.","lat":"Akhad ed-dawa elli wasfo ed-doktor es-sobh.","en":"He took the medicine prescribed this morning."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنراجع الاسم والوقت، ونتابع الوعي والتنفس.","lat":"Hanerage' el-esm wel-wa't, we netabe' el-wa'y wet-tanaffos.","en":"We'll check the medicine name and timing and monitor consciousness and breathing."},{"n":13,"who":"Mother","ar":"أقدر ألمسه أو أساعد؟","lat":"A'dar almeso aw asa'ed?","en":"Can I touch him or help?"},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"خليكي قريبة واتّبعي تعليمات الفريق عشان نساعده بأمان.","lat":"Khalleeki areeba wettabe'i ta'leemat el-faree' ashan nesa'edo be-aman.","en":"Stay nearby and follow the team's instructions so we can help safely."}],"scenario":"Witness history, urgency, safety communication (context: Mother, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L32","module":9,"lesson":32,"unit":8,"title":"Emergency Referral and Transfer","speakers":"Junior doctor, Specialist, Father, Ambulance staff","arc":"SBAR-style transfer, stabilization, consent, transport","objectives":"Deliver concise handover with age, course, findings, interventions and outstanding needs.","roleplay":"Sending facility calls receiving hospital; provide structured handover and family explanation.","caution":"Transfers follow clinical stabilization, referral acceptance, local ambulance protocols and documentation.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"ألو يا دكتور، مع حضرتك دكتورة سارة من طوارئ الأطفال.","lat":"Alo ya doktor, ma'a hadretak doktora Sara men taware' el-atfal.","en":"Hello doctor, this is Dr Sara from pediatric emergency."},{"n":2,"who":"Specialist","ar":"اتفضلي، معانا حالة إيه؟","lat":"Etfaddali, ma'ana hala eh?","en":"Go ahead, what is the case?"},{"n":3,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"طفل عنده أربع سنين، حالته اتدهورت النهارده ومحتاج مستوى رعاية أعلى.","lat":"Tefl ando arba' seneen, halto etdahwaret ennaharda we mehtag mostawa re'aya a'la.","en":"A four-year-old deteriorated today and needs a higher level of care."},{"n":4,"who":"Specialist","ar":"إيه الأعراض والعلامات الحيوية الحالية؟","lat":"Eh el-a'rad wel-alamat el-hayaweyya el-haleyya?","en":"What are the symptoms and current vital signs?"},{"n":5,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"هقول لحضرتك القياسات والنتائج واحد واحد، ومعاها وقت كل قياس.","lat":"Ha'ool le-hadretak el-eyasat wen-natayeg wahed wahed, we ma'aha wa't kol eyas.","en":"I'll give each measurement and result with its time."},{"n":6,"who":"Specialist","ar":"إيه اللي اتعمل لحد دلوقتي؟","lat":"Eh elli et'amel le-hadd delwa'ti?","en":"What has been done so far?"},{"n":7,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"الفريق بدأ الرعاية حسب البروتوكول، وهنرسل ملخص التدخلات والاستجابة.","lat":"El-faree' beda er-re'aya hasab el-protokol, we hanersel molakhkhas et-tadakholat wel-estegaba.","en":"The team started protocol-based care; we'll send a summary of interventions and response."},{"n":8,"who":"Specialist","ar":"هل النقل متنسق مع الإسعاف؟","lat":"Hal en-na'l metnasse' ma'a el-es'af?","en":"Is transfer coordinated with ambulance services?"},{"n":9,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"جاري التنسيق، ومحتاجين تأكيد استقبال الحالة.","lat":"Gari et-tansee', we mehtageen ta'keed este'bal el-hala.","en":"Coordination is underway; we need acceptance confirmation."},{"n":10,"who":"Specialist","ar":"هننسق مع الفريق المستقبِل ونرد عليكم.","lat":"Hanenassa' ma'a el-faree' el-mosta'bel we nerodd aleikum.","en":"We'll coordinate with the receiving team and respond."},{"n":11,"who":"Father","ar":"ليه هتنقلوا ابني لمستشفى تاني؟","lat":"Leh hatna'lo ebni le-mostashfa tani?","en":"Why are you moving my son to another hospital?"},{"n":12,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"لأنه محتاج إمكانيات ومتابعة أكتر من المتاحة هنا.","lat":"Le'enno mehtag emkaneyyat we motaba'a aktar mel-motaha hena.","en":"He needs resources and monitoring beyond what's available here."},{"n":13,"who":"Father","ar":"أروح معاه؟","lat":"Arooh ma'ah?","en":"Can I go with him?"},{"n":14,"who":"Ambulance staff","ar":"هنوضح ترتيبات المرافقة بعد ما نأمن النقل.","lat":"Hanwaddah tarteebat el-morafa'a ba'd ma ne'ammen en-na'l.","en":"We'll explain accompanying arrangements once transport safety is confirmed."},{"n":15,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"هنسلم كل التقارير والأدوية اللي اتاخدت للفريق المستقبِل.","lat":"Hanesallem kol et-ta'areer wel-adweya elli etakhadet lel-faree' el-mosta'bel.","en":"We'll hand over reports and administered medicines to the receiving team."}],"scenario":"SBAR-style transfer, stabilization, consent, transport (context: Specialist, Father, Ambulance staff)","learner":"Junior doctor"},{"id":"M09_L33","module":9,"lesson":33,"unit":9,"title":"Doctor–Nurse Communication","speakers":"Nurse, Doctor","arc":"Structured ward handover, escalation and closed-loop communication","objectives":"Communicate observations, time, trends, actions requested and review interval; close the loop.","roleplay":"Nurse calls doctor about changes overnight; doctor asks clarifying questions and confirms next actions.","caution":"Follow local documentation and escalation thresholds; avoid vague instructions such as “keep an eye on him” without specifics.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Nurse","ar":"يا دكتورة، ممكن تيجي تشوفي الطفل في سرير سبعة؟","lat":"Ya doktora, momken teegi tshoofi et-tefl fi sereer sab'a?","en":"Doctor, could you review the child in bed seven?"},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إيه اللي اتغير؟","lat":"Eh elli etghayyar?","en":"What has changed?"},{"n":3,"who":"Nurse","ar":"الحرارة زادت ونفسه أسرع من آخر مرة.","lat":"El-harara zadet we nafaso asra' men akher marra.","en":"His temperature rose and his breathing is faster than before."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"إمتى لاحظتي التغيير؟","lat":"Emta lahezti et-taghyeer?","en":"When did you notice the change?"},{"n":5,"who":"Nurse","ar":"من ربع ساعة تقريباً.","lat":"Men rob' sa'a ta'reeban.","en":"About fifteen minutes ago."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"قوليلي آخر قياسات بالوقت، وحالة الوعي.","lat":"Ollili akher eyasat bel-wa't, we halet el-wa'y.","en":"Tell me the latest timed measurements and mental status."},{"n":7,"who":"Nurse","ar":"سجلتهم في الملف، وهو صاحي بس تعبان.","lat":"Saggalthom fil-malaf, we howwa sahi bas ta'ban.","en":"I recorded them in the chart; he's awake but unwell."},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هجيلك حالاً وأفحصه، ونبلغ الطبيب المسؤول لو لزم.","lat":"Hagilek halan we afhasso, we nballagh et-tabeeb el-mas'ool law lezem.","en":"I'll come immediately to examine him and notify the senior clinician as needed."},{"n":9,"who":"Nurse","ar":"حاضر، هجهز الملف.","lat":"Hader, hagahhez el-malaf.","en":"Okay, I'll prepare the chart."},{"n":10,"who":"Doctor","ar":"اتأكدي إن عندنا قائمة الأدوية وآخر مواعيدها.","lat":"Et'akkedi en andena ayemet el-adweya we akher mawa'eedha.","en":"Please ensure we have the medication list and last administration times."},{"n":11,"who":"Nurse","ar":"تمام، هراجعها مع سجل التمريض.","lat":"Tamam, harage'ha ma'a segel et-tamreed.","en":"Okay, I'll verify it against the nursing record."},{"n":12,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لو حصل تدهور قبل ما أوصل، فعّلي نظام الاستجابة العاجلة فوراً.","lat":"Law hasal tadahwor abl ma awsal, fa'eli nezam el-estegaba el-agela fawran.","en":"If he deteriorates before I arrive, activate the urgent response system immediately."},{"n":13,"who":"Nurse","ar":"وصلت، وهبلغك بأي تغيير حالاً.","lat":"Weslet, we haballaghik be-ay taghyeer halan.","en":"Understood; I'll tell you about any change immediately."},{"n":14,"who":"Doctor","ar":"متشكرة، هراجع الحالة معاكي عند السرير.","lat":"Motshakkera, harage' el-hala ma'aki and es-sereer.","en":"Thank you. We'll review the case together at the bedside."}],"scenario":"Structured ward handover, escalation and closed-loop communication (context: Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L34","module":9,"lesson":34,"unit":9,"title":"Communicating with Doctors and Specialists","speakers":"Consultant, Junior doctor","arc":"Clinical presentation, differential, plan, disagreement","objectives":"Use a concise case summary and a clear consultation question; discuss uncertainty respectfully.","roleplay":"Senior asks why a certain test was ordered; explain reasoning, then revise based on feedback.","caution":"Summaries are illustrative and intentionally omit numerical values that must come from actual patient assessment.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Consultant","ar":"ابدئي بملخص الحالة في دقيقة.","lat":"Ebda'i be-molakhkhas el-hala fi de'ee'a.","en":"Start with a one-minute case summary."},{"n":2,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"طفلة عندها ست سنين، جايه بوجع بطن وسخونية من يومين.","lat":"Tefla andaha sett seneen, gaya be-waga' batn we sokhoneyya men yomein.","en":"A six-year-old girl presents with abdominal pain and fever for two days."},{"n":3,"who":"Consultant","ar":"إيه أهم حاجة في التاريخ؟","lat":"Eh ahamm haga fit-tareekh?","en":"What's most important in the history?"},{"n":4,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"الوجع اتغير مكانه، وأكلها وشربها قلوا.","lat":"El-waga' etghayyar makano, we aklaha we shorbaha ello.","en":"The pain moved, and her food and fluid intake decreased."},{"n":5,"who":"Consultant","ar":"وإيه نتائج الكشف؟","lat":"We eh natayeg el-kashf?","en":"What were the examination findings?"},{"n":6,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"فيه ألم موضعي، وعايزة أراجع العلامات الحيوية مع حضرتك.","lat":"Feeh alam mawde'i, we ayza arage' el-alamat el-hayaweyya ma'a hadretak.","en":"There is localized tenderness; I'd like to review vital signs with you."},{"n":7,"who":"Consultant","ar":"إيه التشخيصات المحتملة؟","lat":"Eh et-tashkheesat el-mohtamala?","en":"What are the differential diagnoses?"},{"n":8,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"فيه أسباب جراحية وغير جراحية، وقلقانة من سبب محتاج تدخل عاجل.","lat":"Feeh asbab geraheyya we gheir geraheyya, we al'ana men sabab mehtag tadakhkhol agel.","en":"There are surgical and nonsurgical causes, and I'm concerned about one needing urgent intervention."},{"n":9,"who":"Consultant","ar":"إيه السؤال المحدد اللي محتاجة مساعدة فيه؟","lat":"Eh es-so'al el-mohadded elli mehtaga mosa'ada feeh?","en":"What specific question do you need help with?"},{"n":10,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"هل نحتاج مراجعة جراحة أطفال دلوقتي؟","lat":"Hal nehtag moraga'et gerahet atfal delwa'ti?","en":"Do we need pediatric surgical review now?"},{"n":11,"who":"Consultant","ar":"خلينا نكشف عليها سوا ونحدد الأولويات.","lat":"Khallina nekshif aleiha sawa we nehadded el-awlaweyyat.","en":"Let's examine her together and set priorities."},{"n":12,"who":"Junior doctor","ar":"تمام، وهبلغ الأسرة بسبب كل خطوة.","lat":"Tamam, we haballagh el-osra besabab kol khotwa.","en":"Okay; I'll explain each step to the family."},{"n":13,"who":"Consultant","ar":"واتأكدي إن الخطة والمراجعة مكتوبين بوضوح.","lat":"Wet'akkedi en el-khotta wel-moraga'a maktoobeen be-wodoo'.","en":"Make sure the plan and review arrangements are documented clearly."}],"scenario":"Clinical presentation, differential, plan, disagreement (context: Consultant)","learner":"Junior doctor"},{"id":"M09_L35","module":9,"lesson":35,"unit":9,"title":"Hospital Staff and Administrative Communication","speakers":"Doctor, Receptionist, Laboratory staff, Pharmacist, Interpreter coordinator","arc":"Practical hospital navigation and coordination","objectives":"Request services clearly; check identifiers; protect privacy; close administrative gaps.","roleplay":"Family cannot navigate between admissions, blood test and pharmacy; coordinate an interpretable route.","caution":"Never disclose patient information to people without a legitimate clinical or administrative need.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"صباح الخير، محتاجة أتأكد من بيانات طفلة قبل التحليل.","lat":"Sabah el-kheir, mehtaga at'akked men bayanat tefla abl et-tahleel.","en":"Good morning; I need to verify a girl's details before a test."},{"n":2,"who":"Receptionist","ar":"الاسم ورقم الملف لو سمحتي.","lat":"El-esm we ra'am el-malaf law samahti.","en":"Name and file number, please."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هراجع البيانات مع ولي الأمر من غير ما أعلنها قدام الناس.","lat":"Harage' el-bayanat ma'a wali el-amr men gheir ma a'lenha oddam en-nas.","en":"I'll verify details with the guardian without announcing them publicly."},{"n":4,"who":"Receptionist","ar":"تمام، ورقها جاهز في الاستقبال.","lat":"Tamam, wara'aha gahez fil-este'bal.","en":"Okay; her paperwork is ready at reception."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا فندم، المعمل فين بالضبط؟","lat":"Ya fandem, el-ma'mal fein bez-zabt?","en":"Excuse me, where exactly is the laboratory?"},{"n":6,"who":"Laboratory staff","ar":"في الدور الأول، بس لازم نراجع طلب التحليل.","lat":"Fid-dor el-awwel, bas lazem nerage' talab et-tahleel.","en":"On the first floor, but we need to verify the lab order."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"واضح، وهتواصل معاكم لو فيه عينة ناقصة.","lat":"Wadeh, we hatwasel ma'akum law fee ayyna na'sa.","en":"Understood. I'll contact you if a sample is missing."},{"n":8,"who":"Pharmacist","ar":"في وصفة مكتوب فيها اسم الدوا، بس التركيز مش واضح.","lat":"Fi wasfa maktoob feeha esm ed-dawa, bas et-tarkeez mesh wadeh.","en":"This prescription has the drug name but the concentration isn't clear."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكراً إنك نبهتني؛ مش هنصرفه قبل ما نتأكد.","lat":"Shokran ennak nabbahtani; mesh hansarfo abl ma net'akked.","en":"Thanks for flagging it; we won't dispense until it's clarified."},{"n":10,"who":"Interpreter coordinator","ar":"الأسرة محتاجة مترجم؟","lat":"El-osra mehtaga motargem?","en":"Does the family need an interpreter?"},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أيوه، عايزين مترجم معتمد عشان نشرح الموافقة والخطة بدقة.","lat":"Aywa, ayzeen motargem mo'tamad ashan neshrah el-mowafa'a wel-khotta be-de'a.","en":"Yes, we need a qualified interpreter to explain consent and the plan accurately."},{"n":12,"who":"Receptionist","ar":"هنسجل الطلب ونتابع مع القسم.","lat":"Hanesaggel et-talab we netabe' ma'a el-esm.","en":"We'll log the request and follow up with the department."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تمام، مين نقطة التواصل لو الطلب اتأخر؟","lat":"Tamam, meen no'tet et-tawasul law et-talab et'akhkhar?","en":"Great. Who should we contact if the request is delayed?"},{"n":14,"who":"Receptionist","ar":"اتصلي على مكتب التنسيق.","lat":"Ettaseli ala maktab et-tansee'.","en":"Contact the coordination desk."},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"متشكرة، هكتب اسم المسؤول في الملف.","lat":"Motshakkera, hakteb esm el-mas'ool fil-malaf.","en":"Thank you. I'll record the contact in the chart."}],"scenario":"Practical hospital navigation and coordination (context: Receptionist, Laboratory staff, Pharmacist, Interpreter coordinator)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_L36","module":9,"lesson":36,"unit":9,"title":"Discharge, Aftercare and Complete Clinical Simulation","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Child, Father, Senior doctor, Pharmacist, Nurse","arc":"Full encounter from presenting complaint through discharge and safety net","objectives":"Run a whole consultation: history, child engagement, examination, explanation, medicine reconciliation, follow-up, return precautions and teach-back.","roleplay":"Simulate the consultation from beginning to end with a parent who asks repeated questions; swap roles and run an unexpected deterioration branch requiring emergency assessment.","caution":"The scenario is fictional and does not prescribe a diagnosis, fixed medication or dosing. Discharge is appropriate only if the treating team confirms safety.","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"أهلاً، أنا دكتورة سارة. اسم بنتكم إيه؟","lat":"Ahlan, ana doktora Sara. Esm bentkom eh?","en":"Hello, I'm Dr Sara. What's your daughter's name?","scene":{"n":1,"title":"Arrival","setting":"At clinic: mother and father bring a girl with cough."}},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"اسمها سلمى، وعندها خمس سنين.","lat":"Esmaha Salma, we andaha khamas seneen.","en":"Her name is Salma and she's five."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا سلمى، إزيك؟ تحبي تقعدي جنب ماما؟","lat":"Ya Salma, ezzayyek? Tehebbi to'odi gamb mama?","en":"Salma, how are you? Would you like to sit beside Mom?"},{"n":4,"who":"Child","ar":"أيوه.","lat":"Aywa.","en":"Yes."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"احكولي من إمتى بدأت الكحة.","lat":"Ehkooli men emta bedet el-kohha.","en":"Tell me when the cough started."},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"من تلات أيام، وبالليل بتزيد.","lat":"Men talat ayam, we belleil betzeed.","en":"Three days ago; it's worse at night."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه سخونية، صفير، أو صعوبة في التنفس؟","lat":"Feeh sokhoneyya, safeer, aw so'ooba fit-tanaffos?","en":"Any fever, wheeze or breathing difficulty?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"سخنت مرة، لكن بتتنفس كويس دلوقتي.","lat":"Sekhnet marra, lakin betetanaffes kowayyes delwa'ti.","en":"She had a fever once but is breathing comfortably now."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بتشرب كويس؟ وبتلعب زي العادي؟","lat":"Beteshrab kowayyes? We betel'ab zay el-adi?","en":"Is she drinking well and playing normally?"},{"n":10,"who":"Mother","ar":"بتشرب كويس، لكن نشاطها أقل شوية.","lat":"Beteshrab kowayyes, lakin nashatha a'all shewayya.","en":"She's drinking well but a little less active."},{"n":11,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عندها حساسية أو ربو أو أدوية ثابتة؟","lat":"Andaha hassaseyya aw rabw aw adweya sabta?","en":"Any allergies, asthma or regular medicines?"},{"n":12,"who":"Father","ar":"لأ، على حد علمنا.","lat":"La', ala hadd elmna.","en":"No, as far as we know."},{"n":13,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا سلمى، هسمع صدرك بالسماعة وبعدين أبص في حلقك، ينفع؟","lat":"Ya Salma, hasma' sadrik bes-samma'a we ba'dein aboss fi hal'ik, yenfa'?","en":"Salma, I'll listen to your chest and then look at your throat, okay?","scene":{"n":2,"title":"Examination and explanation","setting":"After the history, the doctor explains the examination."}},{"n":14,"who":"Child","ar":"بس السماعة ساقعة!","lat":"Bas es-samma'a sa'e'a!","en":"But the stethoscope is cold!"},{"n":15,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن تبقى ساقعة شوية، وهقولك قبل ما ألمسك.","lat":"Momken teb'a sa'e'a shewayya, we ha'ollik abl ma almesik.","en":"It may be a little cold; I'll tell you before touching you."},{"n":16,"who":"Father","ar":"هل محتاجة أشعة؟","lat":"Hal mehtaga ash'a?","en":"Does she need an X-ray?"},{"n":17,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنقرر حسب الكشف والعلامات الحيوية؛ مش كل كحة محتاجة أشعة.","lat":"Han'arrar hasab el-kashf wel-alamat el-hayaweyya; mesh kol kohha mehtaga ash'a.","en":"We'll decide based on examination and vital signs; not every cough needs an X-ray."},{"n":18,"who":"Mother","ar":"طيب إيه سبب الكحة؟","lat":"Tayyeb eh sabab el-kohha?","en":"So what is causing the cough?"},{"n":19,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هشرح لكم الاحتمالات ودرجة التأكد بعد ما نكمل التقييم.","lat":"Hashrah lakom el-ehtemalat we daraget et-ta'akkod ba'd ma nekammel et-ta'yeem.","en":"I'll explain the possibilities and our level of certainty after completing the assessment."},{"n":20,"who":"Senior doctor","ar":"أنا راجعت الحالة مع دكتورة سارة، وهنوضح الخطة للأسرة.","lat":"Ana rage't el-hala ma'a doktora Sara, we hanwaddah el-khotta lel-osra.","en":"I reviewed the case with Dr Sara, and we'll explain the plan to the family."},{"n":21,"who":"Mother","ar":"هل فيه دواء لازم تاخده؟","lat":"Hal fee dawa lazem takhdo?","en":"Does she need any medicine?","scene":{"n":3,"title":"Treatment discussion","setting":"After the treating team has established an appropriate plan."}},{"n":22,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لو وصفنا دواء، هنتأكد من الوزن والحساسية والتركيز ونكتب التعليمات بوضوح.","lat":"Law wasafna dawa, hanet'akked men el-wazn wel-hassaseyya wet-tarkeez we nekteb et-ta'leemat be-wodoo'.","en":"If we prescribe medicine, we'll verify weight, allergies and concentration and write clear instructions."},{"n":23,"who":"Father","ar":"ولو هنسأل الصيدلي، نقوله إيه؟","lat":"We law hanes'al es-saydali, ne'ollo eh?","en":"If we ask the pharmacist, what should we say?"},{"n":24,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ورّوه الوصفة والعبوة، واسألوه عن طريقة القياس وأي تعارضات.","lat":"Warrooh el-wasfa wel-'obwa, wes'alooh an taree'et el-eyas we ay ta'arodat.","en":"Show the prescription and packaging; ask about measuring and interactions."},{"n":25,"who":"Pharmacist","ar":"هنراجع الاسم والتركيز وطريقة الاستخدام قبل الصرف.","lat":"Hanerage' el-esm wet-tarkeez we taree'et el-estekhdam abl es-sarf.","en":"We'll verify the medicine, concentration and directions before dispensing."},{"n":26,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لو حالتها تسمح بالخروج، هتستلموا تعليمات مكتوبة.","lat":"Law haletha tesmah bel-khoroog, hatestelemo ta'leemat maktooba.","en":"If it's safe for her to go home, you'll receive written instructions.","scene":{"n":4,"title":"Discharge and safety-netting","setting":"Discharge only after an assessment confirming that it is appropriate and safe."}},{"n":27,"who":"Mother","ar":"أراقب إيه في البيت؟","lat":"Ara'eb eh fil-beit?","en":"What should I monitor at home?"},{"n":28,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تابعوا التنفس، الشرب، النشاط، وأي أعراض جديدة أو بتسوء.","lat":"Tabe'o et-tanaffos, esh-shorb, en-nashat, we ay a'rad gedeeda aw betesoo'.","en":"Monitor breathing, drinking, activity, and any new or worsening symptoms."},{"n":29,"who":"Father","ar":"نرجع إمتى فوراً؟","lat":"Nerga' emta fawran?","en":"When should we come back immediately?"},{"n":30,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لو حصل ضيق نفس شديد، صعوبة في إفاقتها، أو مش قادرة تشرب، اطلبوا طوارئ فوراً.","lat":"Law hasal dee' nafas shadeed, so'ooba fi efa'etha, aw mesh adra teshrab, otlobo taware' fawran.","en":"Seek emergency care immediately for severe breathing trouble, difficulty waking her, or inability to drink."},{"n":31,"who":"Mother","ar":"والمتابعة العادية؟","lat":"Wel-motaba'a el-adeyya?","en":"What about routine follow-up?"},{"n":32,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنحددها في ورقة الخروج حسب حالتها.","lat":"Hanhaddedha fi wara'et el-khoroog hasab haletha.","en":"We'll schedule it in the discharge summary based on her condition."},{"n":33,"who":"Nurse","ar":"دي ورقة الخروج، وفيها رقم التواصل لو عندكم سؤال.","lat":"Di wara'et el-khoroog, we feeha ra'am et-tawasul law andakom so'al.","en":"This is the discharge paper with a contact number for questions."},{"n":34,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ممكن تقولولي هتعملوا إيه لو التنفس ساء؟","lat":"Momken te'oolooli hata'melo eh law et-tanaffos sa'?","en":"Can you tell me what you'll do if her breathing worsens?"},{"n":35,"who":"Father","ar":"هنطلب طوارئ فوراً ومش هنستنى معاد المتابعة.","lat":"Hanetlob taware' fawran we mesh hanestanna me'ad el-motaba'a.","en":"We'll seek emergency help immediately and won't wait for the follow-up."},{"n":36,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تمام. يا سلمى، عندك سؤال تحبي تسأليه؟","lat":"Tamam. Ya Salma, andek so'al tehebbi tes'aleeh?","en":"Great. Salma, is there anything you'd like to ask?"},{"n":37,"who":"Child","ar":"أقدر ألعب لما أبقى أحسن؟","lat":"A'dar al'ab lamma ab'a ahsan?","en":"Can I play when I'm feeling better?"},{"n":38,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنحدد الرجوع للنشاط حسب تحسنك ونصيحة الفريق.","lat":"Hanhadded er-rogoo' len-nashat hasab tahassonik we naseehet el-faree'.","en":"We'll guide returning to activity based on your recovery and the team's advice."}],"scenario":"Full encounter from presenting complaint through discharge and safety net (context: Mother, Child, Father, Senior doctor, Pharmacist, Nurse)","learner":"Doctor"}],"lab":[{"id":"M09_B01","module":9,"lab":1,"title":"Phone Follow-Up After an Earlier Visit","speakers":"Doctor, Mother","arc":"Telephone safety net","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ألو، مع حضرتك دكتورة سارة من عيادة الأطفال.","lat":"Alo, ma'a hadretik doktora Sara men eyadet el-atfal.","en":"Hello, this is Dr Sara from the pediatric clinic."},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"أهلاً يا دكتورة.","lat":"Ahlan ya doktora.","en":"Hello, doctor."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"بتكلم مع والدة عمر؟ وممكن نتأكد من هويتك قبل ما نتكلم في معلومات طبية؟","lat":"Betkallem ma'a waldet Omar? We momken net'akked men haweytek abl ma netkallem fi ma'lomat tebbeyya?","en":"Am I speaking with Omar's mother? May we verify your identity before discussing medical information?"},{"n":4,"who":"Mother","ar":"أيوه، أنا مامته.","lat":"Aywa, ana mamto.","en":"Yes, I'm his mother."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عامل إيه من آخر زيارة؟","lat":"Amel eh men akher ziyara?","en":"How has he been since his last visit?"},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"لسه تعبان وأكله قل.","lat":"Lessa ta'ban we aklo ell.","en":"He's still unwell and eating less."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هل ظهرت صعوبة في التنفس أو خمول شديد؟","lat":"Hal zaharet so'ooba fit-tanaffos aw khomool shadeed?","en":"Any breathing difficulty or marked lethargy?"},{"n":8,"who":"Mother","ar":"نفسه أسرع من امبارح.","lat":"Nafaso asra' men embareh.","en":"He's breathing faster than yesterday."},{"n":9,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ده محتاج تقييم عاجل وجهاً لوجه، مش مجرد متابعة بالتليفون.","lat":"Da mehtag ta'yeem agel weghan le-wagh, mesh mogarrad motaba'a bet-telefon.","en":"That needs an urgent in-person assessment, not just phone follow-up."}],"scenario":"Telephone safety net (context: Mother)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B02","module":9,"lab":2,"title":"Aunt Who Has Not Brought the Medication","speakers":"Aunt, Doctor","arc":"Conflicting medicine history","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Aunt","ar":"أنا خالتها، ومامتها مش موجودة.","lat":"Ana khaletha, we mametha mesh mawgooda.","en":"I'm her maternal aunt; her mother isn't here."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكرًا إنك جيتي، مين اداها الدوا؟","lat":"Shokran enniki geeti, meen eddaha ed-dawa?","en":"Thanks for coming. Who gave her the medicine?"},{"n":3,"who":"Aunt","ar":"أنا، بس كنت ماشية على كلام مامتها.","lat":"Ana, bas kont mashya ala kalam mametha.","en":"I did, following what her mother said."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"عندك صورة العبوة أو الوصفة؟","lat":"Andek soret el-'obwa aw el-wasfa?","en":"Do you have a photo of the package or prescription?"},{"n":5,"who":"Aunt","ar":"لأ، ممكن أكلمها.","lat":"La', momken akallemha.","en":"No, I can call her."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ياريت؛ محتاجين الاسم والتركيز والكمية وآخر ميعاد.","lat":"Ya reit; mehtageen el-esm wet-tarkeez wel-kammeyya we akher me'ad.","en":"Please; we need the name, concentration, amount and last administration time."},{"n":7,"who":"Aunt","ar":"حاضر، هجيب التفاصيل.","lat":"Hader, hageeb et-tafaseel.","en":"Okay, I'll get the details."}],"scenario":"Conflicting medicine history (context: Aunt)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B03","module":9,"lab":3,"title":"Older Sibling at the Bedside","speakers":"Sibling, Doctor","arc":"Family inclusion without inappropriate disclosure","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Sibling","ar":"أختي هتفضل في المستشفى كتير؟","lat":"Okhti hatefdal fil-mostashfa keteer?","en":"Will my sister be in hospital long?"},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاهمة إنك قلقان عليها.","lat":"Fahma ennak al'an aleiha.","en":"I understand you're worried about her."},{"n":3,"who":"Sibling","ar":"محدش بيشرحلي حاجة.","lat":"Mahaddesh beyishrahli haga.","en":"Nobody explains anything to me."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنشرح لك اللي ينفع نتكلم فيه حسب سنك وموافقة الأسرة.","lat":"Haneshrah lak elli yenfa' netkallem feeh hasab sennak we mowafa'et el-osra.","en":"We can explain what's appropriate for your age with the family's agreement."},{"n":5,"who":"Sibling","ar":"أقدر أجيب لها لعبتها؟","lat":"A'dar ageeb laha le'betha?","en":"Can I bring her toy?"},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنسأل التمريض عن قواعد القسم، وغالباً ده ممكن يساعدها.","lat":"Hanes'al et-tamreed an awa'ed el-esm, we ghaleban da momken yesa'edha.","en":"We'll check ward rules with nursing; that could help her."},{"n":7,"who":"Sibling","ar":"كويس، هكلم ماما.","lat":"Kowayyes, hakallem mama.","en":"Good, I'll talk to Mom."}],"scenario":"Family inclusion without inappropriate disclosure (context: Sibling)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B04","module":9,"lab":4,"title":"Interpreting for a Non-Arabic-Speaking Guardian","speakers":"Doctor, Coordinator, Father","arc":"Language access","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"الأسرة محتاجة مترجم مؤهل، مش بس حد من الأقارب.","lat":"El-osra mehtaga motargem mo'ahhal, mesh bas hadd mel-a'areb.","en":"The family needs a qualified interpreter, not only a relative."},{"n":2,"who":"Coordinator","ar":"أي لغة مطلوبة؟","lat":"Ay logha matlooba?","en":"Which language is needed?"},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنأكد اللغة المفضلة ونسجل طلب الترجمة.","lat":"Han'akked el-logha el-mofaddala we nesaggel talab et-targama.","en":"We'll confirm the preferred language and register the interpreter request."},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"عربي بتاعي مش كويس.","lat":"Arabi beta'i mesh kowayyes.","en":"My Arabic isn't very good."},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ولا يهمك، عايزين نتأكد إن الكلام واضح بلغتك.","lat":"Wala yehemmak, ayzeen net'akked en el-kalam wadeh be-loghtak.","en":"That's okay; we want to make sure things are clear in your language."},{"n":6,"who":"Coordinator","ar":"هنرتب مكالمة مع مترجم مؤهل.","lat":"Hanratteb mokalma ma'a motargem mo'ahhal.","en":"We'll arrange a call with a qualified interpreter."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ولحد ما ييجي، مش هنخمن معلومات طبية مهمة.","lat":"We le-hadd ma yigi, mesh hankhammen ma'lomat tebbeyya mohemma.","en":"Until then, we won't guess important medical information."}],"scenario":"Language access (context: Coordinator, Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B05","module":9,"lab":5,"title":"Parent Questions Antibiotic Prescription","speakers":"Father, Doctor","arc":"Shared decision-making","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Father","ar":"أنا عايز مضاد قوي عشان ابني يخف بسرعة.","lat":"Ana ayiz modad awi ashan ebni yekheff besor'a.","en":"I want a strong antibiotic so my son improves quickly."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاهمة إنك عايز أفضل علاج ليه.","lat":"Fahma ennak ayiz afdal elag leeh.","en":"I understand you want the best treatment for him."},{"n":3,"who":"Father","ar":"ليه ما تكتبيلوش مضاد وخلاص؟","lat":"Leh ma tektebeelosh modad we khalas?","en":"Why not just prescribe one?"},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لأن المضاد الحيوي مش بيفيد في كل الأسباب، وممكن يسبب آثار جانبية.","lat":"Le'en el-modad el-hayawi mesh beyfeed fi kol el-asbab, we momken yesabbeb athar ganabeyya.","en":"Antibiotics don't help for every cause and can have side effects."},{"n":5,"who":"Father","ar":"يعني هتسيبيه من غير علاج؟","lat":"Ya'ni hateseebeeh men gheir elag?","en":"So you're leaving him untreated?"},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لأ، هنشرح خطة الرعاية حسب تقييمه، حتى لو المضاد مش مناسب.","lat":"La', haneshrah khottet er-re'aya hasab ta'yeemo, hatta law el-modad mesh monaseb.","en":"No, we'll explain the care plan based on assessment, even if an antibiotic isn't appropriate."},{"n":7,"who":"Father","ar":"طيب إيه علامات الخطر؟","lat":"Tayyeb eh alamat el-khatar?","en":"What are the warning signs?"},{"n":8,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنكتبها لحالته ونتأكد إنك عارف إمتى ترجع فوراً.","lat":"Hanektebha le-halto we net'akked ennak aref emta terga' fawran.","en":"We'll write them for his situation and ensure you know when to return immediately."}],"scenario":"Shared decision-making (context: Father)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B06","module":9,"lab":6,"title":"Concerns About Cost and Access","speakers":"Mother, Doctor, Social worker","arc":"Access barriers and plan modification","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Mother","ar":"الدوا غالي، ومش عارفة هقدر أجيبه.","lat":"Ed-dawa ghali, we mesh arfa ha'dar ageebo.","en":"The medicine is expensive; I'm not sure I can get it."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكراً إنك قلتيلي، لازم نعمل خطة تقدري تنفذيها.","lat":"Shokran enniki oltilli, lazem na'mel khotta te'dari tenaffeziha.","en":"Thank you for telling me; we need a plan you can actually follow."},{"n":3,"who":"Mother","ar":"ومش هقدر أرجع العيادة كل يوم.","lat":"We mesh ha'dar arga' el-eyyada kol yom.","en":"I can't return to the clinic every day either."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنشوف البدائل المناسبة والمتاحة، من غير ما نضحي بالأمان.","lat":"Haneshoof el-badayel el-monasba wel-motaha, men gheir ma nedahhi bel-aman.","en":"We'll consider appropriate available alternatives without compromising safety."},{"n":5,"who":"Social worker","ar":"ممكن أراجع معاكم الدعم المتاح وترتيبات المواصلات.","lat":"Momken arage' ma'akum ed-da'm el-motah we tarteebat el-mowasalat.","en":"I can review available support and transport arrangements."},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"ده هيساعدني جداً.","lat":"Da hayesa'edni geddan.","en":"That would help a lot."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هنكتب مين هتتواصلي معاه لو الخطة صعبت.","lat":"Hanekteb meen hatetwaseli ma'ah law el-khotta sa'bet.","en":"We'll write down whom to contact if the plan becomes difficult."}],"scenario":"Access barriers and plan modification (context: Mother, Social worker)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B07","module":9,"lab":7,"title":"Sensitive Safeguarding Concern","speakers":"Doctor, Child","arc":"Non-leading inquiry and escalation","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"يا حبيبي، أنا هنا عشان أسمعك وأساعدك.","lat":"Ya habibi, ana hena ashan asma'ak we asa'edak.","en":"I'm here to listen and help you."},{"n":2,"who":"Child","ar":"مش عايز أتكلم قدام حد.","lat":"Mesh ayiz atkallem oddam hadd.","en":"I don't want to talk in front of anyone."},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"تمام، هنشوف مكان آمن ومناسب للكلام حسب القواعد هنا.","lat":"Tamam, haneshoof makan amen we monaseb lel-kalam hasab el-awa'ed hena.","en":"Okay, we'll arrange a safe and appropriate setting under local procedures."},{"n":4,"who":"Child","ar":"لو قلت حاجة هتزعلوا مني؟","lat":"Law olt haga hatez'alo minni?","en":"Will you be angry if I say something?"},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لأ، مش هلومك؛ شكراً إنك بتحاول تحكي.","lat":"La', mesh haloomak; shokran ennak bethawel tehki.","en":"No, I won't blame you; thank you for trying to tell me."},{"n":6,"who":"Doctor","ar":"في حاجات لو بتأثر على سلامتك لازم أطلب مساعدة من الفريق المختص، وهشرح لك.","lat":"Fi hagat law bete'asser ala salamtak lazem atlob mosa'ada mel-faree' el-mokhtass, we hashrahlak.","en":"If something threatens your safety I may need to get specialist help, and I'll explain that."},{"n":7,"who":"Child","ar":"حاضر.","lat":"Hader.","en":"Okay."}],"scenario":"Non-leading inquiry and escalation (context: Child)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B08","module":9,"lab":8,"title":"Reviewing an Unexpected Lab Delay","speakers":"Mother, Doctor, Lab technician","arc":"Clear delays and contact ownership","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Mother","ar":"التحليل اتأخر، نفضل مستنيين؟","lat":"Et-tahleel et'akhkhar, nefdal mestanneen?","en":"The test is delayed; should we keep waiting?"},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هتأكد من المعمل، وبنفس الوقت هنراجع حالة الطفل.","lat":"Hat'akked mel-ma'mal, we benafs el-wa't hanerage' halet et-tefl.","en":"I'll check with the lab and reassess the child in the meantime."},{"n":3,"who":"Lab technician","ar":"الجهاز محتاج إعادة معايرة، فالنتيجة هتتأخر.","lat":"El-gehaz mehtag e'adet mo'ayara, fen-nateega hatet'akhkhar.","en":"The instrument needs recalibration, so the result will be delayed."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"هل فيه بديل موثوق؟ ومين هيبلغنا أول ما النتيجة تطلع؟","lat":"Hal fee badeel mawsoo'? We meen hayballaghna awwel ma en-nateega tetla'?","en":"Is there a reliable alternative, and who will notify us when the result is ready?"},{"n":5,"who":"Lab technician","ar":"هنسجل رقم التواصل ونتصل بيكم فوراً.","lat":"Hanesaggel ra'am et-tawasul we nettasel beekum fawran.","en":"We'll record the contact and call as soon as possible."},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"ده هيأخر العلاج؟","lat":"Da hay'akhkhar el-elag?","en":"Will this delay treatment?"},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"لو في رعاية عاجلة مطلوبة مش هنأخرها لمجرد إن التحليل متأخر.","lat":"Law fi re'aya agela matlooba mesh han'akhkharha lemogarrad en et-tahleel met'akhkhar.","en":"We won't delay urgent care simply because the result is delayed."}],"scenario":"Clear delays and contact ownership (context: Mother, Lab technician)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B09","module":9,"lab":9,"title":"Parent Requests Discharge Against Advice","speakers":"Father, Doctor, Senior doctor","arc":"Risk explanation and documentation","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Father","ar":"لازم آخد ابني وأمشي دلوقتي.","lat":"Lazem akhod ebni wemshi delwa'ti.","en":"I have to take my son and leave now."},{"n":2,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فاهمة إن عندك ظرف، ممكن نفهم السبب ونحاول نساعد؟","lat":"Fahma en andak zarf, momken nefham es-sabab we nehawel nesa'ed?","en":"I understand you have a pressing need; can we understand and try to help?"},{"n":3,"who":"Father","ar":"عندي طفل تاني لوحده في البيت.","lat":"Andi tefl tani lewahdo fil-beit.","en":"I have another child alone at home."},{"n":4,"who":"Doctor","ar":"شكراً إنك وضحت. إحنا قلقانين لأن حالة ابنك محتاجة متابعة هنا.","lat":"Shokran ennak waddaht. Ehna al'aneen le'en halet ebnak mehtaga motaba'a hena.","en":"Thanks for explaining. We're worried because your son needs monitoring here."},{"n":5,"who":"Senior doctor","ar":"هنشرح المخاطر والخيارات، ونشوف إذا نقدر نساعد في ظرف البيت.","lat":"Haneshrah el-makhater wel-khiyarat, we neshoof eza ne'dar nesa'ed fi zarf el-beit.","en":"We'll explain risks and options and see whether we can assist with the situation at home."},{"n":6,"who":"Father","ar":"أنا مش عايز أعرّضه للخطر.","lat":"Ana mesh ayiz a'arrado lel-khatar.","en":"I don't want to put him at risk."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"خلينا نتفق على خطة آمنة حسب التقييم والقواعد الطبية والقانونية هنا.","lat":"Khallina nettafe' ala khotta amna hasab et-ta'yeem wel-awa'ed et-tebbeyya wel-anoneyya hena.","en":"Let's agree on a safe plan based on the assessment and applicable clinical and legal requirements."}],"scenario":"Risk explanation and documentation (context: Father, Senior doctor)","learner":"Doctor"},{"id":"M09_B10","module":9,"lab":10,"title":"Explaining Uncertain News Compassionately","speakers":"Doctor, Mother, Father, Consultant","arc":"Difficult news and empathy","ex":[{"n":1,"who":"Doctor","ar":"ينفع نقعد في مكان هادي ونتكلم شوية؟","lat":"Yenfa' no'od fi makan hadi we netkallem shewayya?","en":"Could we sit somewhere quiet and talk for a moment?"},{"n":2,"who":"Mother","ar":"في حاجة ظهرت في النتيجة؟","lat":"Fi haga zaharet fin-nateega?","en":"Did something show up in the result?"},{"n":3,"who":"Doctor","ar":"فيه نتيجة محتاجة متابعة وفحوصات إضافية، ولسه ما عندناش تشخيص نهائي.","lat":"Feeh nateega mehtaga motaba'a we fohosat edafeyya, we lessa ma andenash tashkhees neha'i.","en":"There's a finding that needs follow-up and further tests; we don't have a final diagnosis yet."},{"n":4,"who":"Father","ar":"ده معناه إيه لمستقبله؟","lat":"Da ma'nah eh le-mosta'balo?","en":"What does this mean for his future?"},{"n":5,"who":"Doctor","ar":"مش هخمن؛ هنقول لكم اللي معروف واللي لسه مش واضح.","lat":"Mesh hakhammen; han'ool lakom elli ma'roof welli lessa mesh wadeh.","en":"I won't speculate; we'll explain what is known and what remains uncertain."},{"n":6,"who":"Mother","ar":"أنا محتاجة دقيقة أستوعب.","lat":"Ana mehtaga de'ee'a astaw'eb.","en":"I need a moment to take this in."},{"n":7,"who":"Doctor","ar":"طبعاً، خدي وقتك؛ إحنا هنا نسمع أسئلتكم.","lat":"Tab'an, khodi wa'tik; ehna hena nesma' as'eltokom.","en":"Of course, take your time; we're here for your questions."},{"n":8,"who":"Consultant","ar":"هنحدد الخطوات الجاية ومين هيكون مسؤول عن المتابعة.","lat":"Hanhadded el-khotawat el-gayya we meen hayekoon mas'ool an el-motaba'a.","en":"We'll outline next steps and who will coordinate follow-up."}],"scenario":"Difficult news and empathy (context: Mother, Father, Consultant)","learner":"Doctor"}],"guide":{"register":{"intro":"Egyptian caregivers may alternate between respectful forms and everyday colloquial language. Choose phrasing that is polite, clear and appropriate to the family. Always confirm meaning rather than relying on a memorized line.","rows":[{"f":"حضرتكِ / حضرتِك","m":"حضرتك","note":"hadretik / hadretak — polite “you”"},{"f":"إنتِ","m":"إنتَ","note":"enti / enta — you"},{"f":"عاملة إيه؟","m":"عامل إيه؟","note":"aamla eh? / aamel eh? — how are you?"},{"f":"تعبانة","m":"تعبان","note":"ta‘bana / ta‘ban — tired or unwell"},{"f":"فاهمة","m":"فاهم","note":"fahma / fahem — I understand, speaker gender"},{"f":"عايزة","m":"عايز","note":"ayza / ayiz — I want / need, speaker gender"},{"f":"خدي وقتك","m":"خد وقتك","note":"khodi wa‘tik / khod wa‘tak — take your time"},{"f":"قوليلي","m":"قولّي","note":"ollili / olli — tell me"},{"f":"خايفة","m":"خايف","note":"khayfa / khayef — scared"},{"f":"محتاجة","m":"محتاج","note":"mehtaga / mehtag — needs / I need, context-dependent"},{"f":"اسألي","m":"اسأل","note":"es‘ali / es‘al — ask"},{"f":"اتفضلي","m":"اتفضل","note":"etfaddali / etfaddal — go ahead / please"}],"examples":[{"label":"Parent, respectful","ar":"إيه اللي مقلق حضرتك؟","lat":"Eh elli me’alla’ hadretak/hadretik?","en":"What worries you?"},{"label":"Parent, ordinary","ar":"إيه اللي مقلقك؟","lat":"Eh elli me’alla’ak/me’alla’ek?","en":"What worries you?"},{"label":"Child","ar":"ورّيني فين الوجع.","lat":"Warreeni fein el-waga’.","en":"Show me where it hurts."},{"label":"Clinical team","ar":"ممكن تديني ملخص سريع؟","lat":"Momken teddeeni molakhkhas saree’?","en":"Can you give me a brief handover?"},{"label":"Uncertainty","ar":"لسه ما نقدرش نجزم.","lat":"Lessa ma ne’darsh negzem.","en":"We cannot be certain yet."},{"label":"Safety-netting","ar":"لو حالته ساءت، ما تستنوش.","lat":"Law halto sa’et, ma testannosh.","en":"If the condition worsens, don’t wait."}]},"patterns":[{"title":"Structured history","text":"open question → chronology → severity → associated symptoms → hydration/activity/urine → past history/medicines/allergies → caregiver observations → summary."},{"title":"Explain a clinical impression","text":"“Here is what we know” → “Here is what is possible but unconfirmed” → “Here is what we need to assess” → “Here is who is responsible” → “When we will reassess.”"},{"title":"Medicine conversation","text":"verify identity, weight, allergy history, specific medicine, formulation and concentration → give only verified individualized directions → show measuring device → check missed-dose instructions → confirm understanding → return precautions."},{"title":"Emergency communication","text":"name the immediate concern → request the team → give current facts and timing → distinguish observed findings from assumptions → state what has already been done → confirm the handover was received → update family as feasible."},{"title":"Discharge conversation","text":"explain diagnosis or uncertainty → medication reconciliation and instructions → practical care at home → warning signs and urgent-return threshold → follow-up provider and timing → teach-back → written plan and contact details."},{"title":"Child-centered care","text":"speak with the child, not only about the child; use simple words and honest explanations; give appropriate choices; allow caregiver support; consider development and communication needs."}],"cases":[{"id":"A","title":"Fever, worried parents","text":"Mother says the child had fever overnight; father asks for antibiotics; the child complains of throat pain. Take a complete history, explain why examination comes first, and give individualized safety-net language."},{"id":"B","title":"Infant with poor feeding","text":"Grandmother brings a very young infant who is less responsive and has fewer wet diapers. Identify caregiver authority and missing history; request immediate clinical assessment and contact the legal guardian without delaying urgent care."},{"id":"C","title":"Breathing trouble at triage","text":"Father describes chest retractions and difficulty speaking; nurse needs a concise handover. Escalate, communicate serious uncertainty honestly and give a clear team summary."},{"id":"D","title":"Abdominal pain and difficult questions","text":"Child points to worsening right-sided pain and mother requests food advice. Ask urgent screening questions, request examination, avoid premature diagnosis and explain next steps."},{"id":"E","title":"Chronic condition at school","text":"Adolescent is missing treatment at school; caregiver is worried about disclosure. Discuss adherence without blame, confidentiality boundaries and a written school action plan."},{"id":"F","title":"Discharge and conflicting medication bottles","text":"Mother has two strengths of a medicine, father wants to measure with a teaspoon and a pharmacist asks for clarification. Reconcile product, explain accurate measurement, and use teach-back."},{"id":"G","title":"Language access and consent","text":"Non-Arabic-speaking guardian is offered a relative as interpreter. Arrange qualified interpretation, confirm identity, explain uncertainty and document authorization appropriately."},{"id":"H","title":"Complex ward review","text":"Nurse reports concerning changes in observations. Junior doctor calls consultant and receiving service. Deliver sequential concise SBAR-style handovers and update family."},{"id":"I","title":"Developmental concern","text":"Mother compares a toddler to an older sibling. Gather development and hearing history, acknowledge worry, explain evaluation and avoid premature labels."},{"id":"J","title":"Difficult conversation with two caregivers","text":"Father declines proposed admission while mother wants observation. Explore barriers respectfully, describe risks in plain language, involve a senior doctor and avoid unsupported assurances."}],"checklist":["Open a consultation with a parent or guardian respectfully.","Ask a child directly about pain in age-appropriate Egyptian Arabic.","Take a full symptom history with clear time and severity questions.","Ask neutrally about medicines, concentrations and allergies.","Identify verbal descriptions of urgent danger signs and clearly call for help.","Explain a suspected but unconfirmed diagnosis without overstating certainty.","Explain why a test or referral is being considered.","Discuss a medication and confirm the measuring method without guessing a dose.","Explain sensitive concerns privately and describe confidentiality limits.","Hand over a pediatric case to a nurse, consultant or receiving hospital.","Coordinate with reception, laboratory, pharmacy and interpreting staff.","Explain aftercare, urgent-return signs, follow-up and confirm understanding."],"review":"This document is a language-learning draft. Before using its phrases as patient-facing scripts, obtain review from (1) a native Egyptian Arabic-speaking clinician for naturalness, register, and gender; and (2) a practicing pediatric clinician for clinical relevance and local protocols. Medicine instructions, referral pathways, vaccine schedules and consent laws must always be checked locally.","references":[{"org":"World Health Organization","title":"IMCI: general danger signs in a sick child","url":"https://iris.who.int/bitstream/handle/10665/104772/9789241506823_Module-1_eng.pdf","note":""},{"org":"World Health Organization","title":"Postnatal care and newborn danger signs","url":"https://iris.who.int/bitstream/handle/10665/352658/9789240045989-eng.pdf","note":""},{"org":"American Academy of Pediatrics","title":"How to Use Liquid Medicines for Children","url":"https://www.healthychildren.org/English/safety-prevention/at-home/medication-safety/Pages/Using-Liquid-Medicines.aspx","note":""},{"org":"American Academy of Pediatrics","title":"Confidentiality in the Care of Adolescents (2024)","url":"https://publications.aap.org/pediatrics/article/153/5/e2024066326/197124/","note":""},{"org":"CDC","title":"Childhood Vaccine Schedules","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/vaccines-children/schedules/index.html","note":"US schedule is **not** a substitute for the current Egyptian/local schedule"}],"labIntro":"These are **additional complete short dialogues**, not additional numbered lessons. They can be used after the relevant main lesson or as unpredictable role-play branches.","casesIntro":"The following are instructor/partner prompts, **not additional pre-scripted lessons**. Use vocabulary and conversation structures from earlier lessons to respond naturally.","checklistTitle":"Mastery Checklist (Language Practice, Not Clinical Credentialing)"}};
